t colors and/or sizes.'=>'<b>Variable –</b> potlh ‘e’ Qapchu’ mIw, Hoch potlhmeyvam SKU, Qap, je’ tlheghmey vItlhutlhlu’. Dochmeyvam: t-shirt Doq je loDlu’ qonwI’mey je/joq.','Product types define available product details and attributes, such as downloadable files and variations. They’re also used for analytics and inventory management.'=>'Potlhmey chu’vam Qapchu’ potlhmey chenmoHbogh je attributes, QumwI’ filemey je variations. chaq analytics je inventory management vItlhutlhlu’.','Describe this product. What makes it unique? What are its most important features?'=>'potlhvam QumwI’. nuq vIghro’pu’? nuq vIyajbogh Qapchu’?','Summarize this product in 1-2 short sentences. We’ll show it at the top of the page.'=>'potlhvam QumwI’ 1-2 mIw machmey. wIleghlaHmeH Daq yItlhutlh.','Make sure you enter the name and values for each attribute.'=>'QumwI’ pongmey je qechmey Hoch attributesmey.','For best results, upload JPEG or PNG files that are 1000 by 1000 pixels or larger. Maximum upload file size: %1$s.'=>'Qapchu’ je’, JPEG pagh PNG filemey 1000 by 1000 pixels pagh nIvbogh upload chu’. upload file size nIvbogh: %1$s.','If you remove this attribute, customers will no longer be able to purchase some variations of this product.'=>'QumwI’vam Hegh, wIj vItlhutlhbogh variationsmey potlhvam vIleghlaHbe’.','Adding new attribute failed.'=>'chu’ ghu’vam Hoch tuQ.','Enter some descriptive text. Use “%s” to separate different values.'=>'QumwI’ tIn. “%s” lo’ Hoch qechmey vItlhutlh.','Enter options for customers to choose from, f.e. “Blue” or “Large”. Use “%s” to separate different options.'=>'QumwI’ Daqmeyvam lo’ Hoch vItlhutlh, f.e. “Doq” pagh “tIn”. “%s” lo’ Hoch qechmey vItlhutlh.','Copying to clipboard failed. Please press Ctrl/Cmd+C to copy.'=>'clipboard QumwI’vam Qapchu’be’. Ctrl/Cmd+C Daq QumwI’.','Are you sure you want to delete this log?'=>'SoHlu’meH nIvbogh wIj logvam chImmoH?','Are you sure you want to run this tool?'=>'SoHlu’meH nIvbogh wIj mIwvam Qap?','Learn More'=>'Qugh yI