itor key metrics with a new and improved interface and dashboard.'=>'store reportmey yIqaw \'ej Qan metrics monitor, new \'ej Quch interface \'ej dashboard.','WooCommerce Admin icon'=>'WooCommerce Admin icon','Mailchimp'=>'Mailchimp','Join the 16 million customers who use Mailchimp. Sync list and store data to send automated emails, and targeted campaigns.'=>'Mailchimp lo’laHmeyvam lo’moHbogh million 16 ’oHmeyDaq qatlh. Qum wIghaj, Data chenmoHmeH Sync list, ’ej automated emails, targeted campaigns ghu’vam patlhmey.','Mailchimp icon'=>'Mailchimp yIq','Mailchimp for WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce vIghro’ Mailchimp','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Enjoy all Facebook products combined in one extension: pixel tracking, catalog sync, messenger chat, shop functionality and Instagram shopping (coming soon)!'=>'Facebook mIw wIghaj: pixel tracking, catalog sync, messenger chat, shop functionality ’ej Instagram shopping (DaHjaj maH) chu’!','Facebook icon'=>'Facebook yIq','Facebook for WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce vIghro’ Facebook','payment setup, automated taxes and discounted shipping labels'=>'payment setup, automated taxes ’ej discounted shipping labels','payment setup and automated taxes'=>'payment setup ’ej automated taxes','payment setup and discounted shipping labels'=>'payment setup ’ej discounted shipping labels','payment setup'=>'payment setup','automated taxes and discounted shipping labels'=>'automated taxes ’ej discounted shipping labels','automated taxes'=>'automated taxes','discounted shipping labels'=>'discounted shipping labels','Sorry, we couldn\'t connect your store to Jetpack'=>'Sorry, Jetpack lo’laHbe’ wIghoSbe’','Your store is almost ready! To activate services like %s, just connect with Jetpack.'=>'pa’logh puS! %s chenmoHmeH Jetpack lo’laHbe’.','Thanks for using Jetpack! Your store is almost ready: to activate services like %s, just connect your store.'=>'Jetpack lo’laHbe’! puS %s chenmoHmeH yIghoS.','Connect your store to Jetpack'=>'Jetpack lo’laHbe’ yIghoS','Connec