 contact Jetpack just now 😭. Please make sure that your site is visible over the internet, and that it accepts incoming and outgoing requests via curl. You can also try to connect to Jetpack again, and if you run into any more issues, please contact support.'=>'yIvoqQo’! Jetpack vIqawbe’ DaHjaj 😭. SoHvaD Dujmey ghu’vamDaq, vItlhutlh, curl nIvbogh mIw nIvbogh. Jetpack yIqaw chel, Qapla’taHvIS support yIqaw.','Your site might be on a private network. Jetpack can only connect to public sites. Please make sure your site is visible over the internet, and then try connecting again 🙏.'=>'SoHvaD private networkDaq yIbuS. Jetpack public Dujmey DaqaS. SoHvaD internetDaq nIvbogh, yIqaw chel 🙏.','Visit WooCommerce.com to learn more about <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">getting started</a>.'=>'WooCommerce.com vItlhutlhmeH <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Qapchu\' tlhutlh</a>.','You\'re ready to start selling!'=>'SoH wIv tlhutlh!','We\'re here for you — get tips, product updates, and inspiration straight to your mailbox.'=>'maHvaD — tips, Duj updates, ‘ej inspiration mailboxDaq neH.','Yes please!'=>'HIja’!','Next step'=>'QaStaHvIS mIw','Create some products'=>'Dujmey yIqaw','You\'re ready to add products to your store.'=>'SoH wIv tlhutlh Dujmey qorDu’.','Create a product'=>'Duj yIqaw','Have an existing store?'=>'Duj QatlhwIj vIghro’?','Import products'=>'Dujmey yIqaw','Transfer existing products to your new store — just import a CSV file.'=>'Dujmey QatlhwIj qorDu’ DaqaS — CSV file yIqaw.','You can also:'=>'vaj:','Visit Dashboard'=>'Dashboard yIlegh','Review Settings'=>'Settings yIlegh','View &amp; Customize'=>'yIlegh &amp; Customize','Tool does not exist.'=>'mIw DaqDaq yIbuS.','Your changes have been saved.'=>'SoH chenmoHmey yIqaw.','You do not have permission to manage log entries.'=>'SoH permission log entries mIw yIqawbe’.','Missing base tables: %s. Some WooCommerce functionality may not work as expected.'=>'QapmeH base tables: %s. WooCommerce mIw vItlhutlh Qapbe’.','Visit plugin