h mIw tIq','When product stock reaches this amount you will be notified by email. It is possible to define different values for each variation individually. The shop default value can be set in Settings > Products > Inventory.'=>'qaStaHvIS ghItlh mIwvam neH, tlhIngan Hol mIwDaq HIqDaq yImev. \'oHmeyDaq mIw QInmeyDaq latlh mIw chenmoH. DuSaQmeyDaq chach mIw \'oH Settings > Products > Inventory mIwDaq.','Stock management disabled in store settings'=>'ghItlh je QIn chenmoH DuSaQmeyDaq Qeng','Disabled in <a href="%s" aria-label="stock management store settings">store settings</a>.'=>'DuSaQmeyDaq <a href="%s" aria-label="ghItlh je QIn DuSaQmeyDaq">ghItlh je QIn DuSaQmeyDaq</a>','Stock status'=>'ghItlh mIw','Controls whether or not the product is listed as "in stock" or "out of stock" on the frontend.'=>'qaStaHvIS QIn mIw pong "ghItlh vImuS" pagh "ghItlh vIghoS" mIwDaq lo\'laHbe\'.','Sold individually'=>'wa\'logh Dungmey','Limit purchases to 1 item per order'=>'wa\'logh mIwDaq mIw HIvje\' pagh','Check to let customers to purchase only 1 item in a single order. This is particularly useful for items that have limited quantity, for example art or handmade goods.'=>'wa\'logh mIw HIvje\' pagh mIw HIvje\' pagh Qapchu\' mIw. \'oHmeyDaq mIw QInmeyDaq Qapchu\' mIw, latlh \'oHmey chenmoH, nuqneH art pagh mIw chenmoH.','This lets you choose which products are part of this group.'=>'vaj \'oHmeyvam \'oH mIwvam nIvbogh \'oHmey mIw.','Upsells are products which you recommend instead of the currently viewed product, for example, products that are more profitable or better quality or more expensive.'=>'ngevwI\'pu\'vam QunvamDaq ngevwI\'pu\'vam QunvamDaq, vaj QunvamDaq, vaj QunvamDaq, vaj QunvamDaq mIw.','Cross-sells are products which you promote in the cart, based on the current product.'=>'choq ngevwI\'pu\'vam cartDaq ngevwI\'pu\'vam ngevwI\'pu\'vam ngevwI\'pu\'vam.','Product Type'=>'mIw Segh','Weight in decimal form'=>'mIw mIw decimal mIw','Dimensions (%s)'=>'mIw mIw (%s)','Length'=>'mIw mIw','Width'=>'mIw mIw','Height'=>'mIw mIw','LxWxH in decimal form'=>'LxWxH decimal mIw','No shipping class'=>'ghItlh mIw Qapchu\'be\'','Shipping classes are used by certain shipping methods to group similar products.'=>'ghItlh mIw qo\' mIw chenmoHmey mIw mIw mIw chenmoH.','Add some attributes in the <a class="variations-add-attributes-link" href="%1$s">Attributes</a> tab to generate variations. Make sure to check the <b>Used for variations</b> box. <a class="variations-learn-more-link" href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Learn more</a>'=>'Qo\' <a class="variations-add-attributes-link" href="%1$s">Attributes</a> mIwDaq chenmoH mIw. <b>Used for variations</b> box yIbuS. <a class="variations-learn-more-link" href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">pIq yIlo\'</a>','Default Form Values'=>'mIw mIw mIw','Choose a default form value if you want a certain variation already selected when a user visits the product page.'=>'mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw.','No default %s&hellip;'=>'mIw mIw %s&hellip; Qapchu\'be\'','Generate variations'=>'vItlhutlhmey vItu\'','Add manually'=>'ghItlh mIw','Delete all variations'=>'vItlhutlhmey Hoch Qaw\'','Toggle &quot;Enabled&quot;'=>'"Qap" toggle','Toggle &quot;Downloadable&quot;'=>'"Downloadable" toggle','Toggle &quot;Virtual&quot;'=>'"Virtual" toggle','Pricing'=>'mIw','Set regular prices'=>'mIw mIwmey chu\'','Increase regular prices (fixed amount or percentage)'=>'mIw mIwmey Qun (nIvbogh pagh Daqmey QaQ)','Decrease regular prices (fixed amount or percentage)'=>'mIw mIwmey Qun (nIvbogh pagh Daqmey tIm)','Set sale prices'=>'Sale mIwmey chu\'','Increase sale prices (fixed amount or percentage)'=>'Sale mIwmey Qun (nIvbogh pagh Daqmey QaQ)','Decrease sale prices (fixed amount or percentage)'=>'Sale mIwmey Qun (nIvbogh pagh Daqmey tIm)','Set scheduled sale dates'=>'Sale jImej mIwmey chu\'','Remove custom costs'=>'mIw chenmoH wIj Qaw\'','Toggle &quot;Manage stock&quot;'=>'"Manage stock" toggle','Set Status - In stock'=>'QaD Status - paw','Set Status - Out of stock'=>'QaD Status - qeylIS','Set Status - On backorder'=>'QaD Status - Qay\'be\'','Weight'=>'ngup','Downloadable products'=>'Downloadable mIwmey','%s item'=>'%s mIw' . "\0" . '%s mIwmey','Go to the first page'=>'wa\' logh Daq','Go to the previous page'=>'naDev logh Daq','Select Page'=>'logh vIghro\'','Current page'=>'DaH logh','Go to the next page'=>'maSlogh Daq','Go to the last page'=>'Qavlogh Daq','No variations yet. Generate them from all added attributes or add a new variation manually.'=>'Hoch vItlhutlhmey \'ach Qaw\'bej. Hoch chenmoHmeyvaD vItlhutlhmey vItu\' \'ej ghItlh mIw vItu\'.','Save changes'=>'pIq chenmoH','Add price to all variations that don\'t have a price'=>'mIw Hochmey tInwI’meyDaq tInwI’ HochmeyDaq tInwI’ wIpoSmeH','Add prices'=>'tInwI’mey tIn','File name'=>'paq pong','https://'=>'https://','Choose file'=>'paq wIv','Insert file URL'=>'paq URL chenmoH','Drag and drop, or click to set admin variation order'=>'cheb ‘ej pIm, pagh click QaghwI’ mIw mIwDaq chaq chaH','Any %s&hellip;'=>'Hoch %s&hellip;','Remove this image'=>'vaj woDDI’ muq','Upload an image'=>'woDDI’ muq','Enabled'=>'Qap','Enable this option if access is given to a downloadable file upon purchase of a product'=>'Qapchu’ ‘oHmeH, DaqmeyDaq downloadable woDDI’ HeghDI’ mIw lo’laH','Enable this option if a product is not shipped or there is no shipping cost'=>'Qapchu’ ‘oHmeH, woDDI’ je’be’ pagh je’be’ HeghDI’ mIw lo’laH','Enable this option to enable stock management at variation level'=>'Qapchu’ ‘oHmeH, mIwDaq wIghaj mIwDaq tInwI’ tu’lu’','Manage stock?'=>'tInwI’ ghotpu’ vItlhutlh?','Regular price (%s)'=>'raS mInDu’ (%s)','Variation price (required)'=>'mIw tInwI’ mInDu’ (law’)','Sale price (%s)'=>'Sale mInDu’ (%s)','Cancel schedule'=>'yItlhutlh Qap lojmIt','Sale start date'=>'Sale Qoj mInDu’','Sale end date'=>'Sale Qap mInDu’','Cost (%s)'=>'qIm (%s)','Add the amount it costs you to buy or make this product. Leave blank to use the default value from "General".'=>'naQmey tInwI’ SIQpu’ pagh mua’ ‘oHlaH. ‘ej “General” mIwDaq lut vIghro’','You can specify a <a href="#" class="switch-to-general-tab">default value</a> for all variations'=>'Hoch mIw tInwI’ vItlhutlh ‘oHmey <a href="#" class="switch-to-general-tab">lut vIghro’</a> yIlo’','%s (default)'=>'%s (lut vIghro’)','Stock quantity'=>'tInwI’ DeS','Enter a number to set stock quantity at the variation level. Use a variation\'s \'Manage stock?\' check box above to enable/disable stock management at the variation level.'=>'mIwDaq tInwI’ DeS pe’ vIghro’ yItlhutlh. mIwDaq ‘Manage stock?’ checkbox yItlhutlh tInwI’ DeSwIj tInwI’ ghotpu’ vItlhutlh','If managing stock, this controls whether or not backorders are allowed. If enabled, stock quantity can go below 0.'=>'tInwI’ SIQpu’ ‘e’ vItlhutlh, ‘ej backorders lo’laHbe’ pagh. Qapchu’ ‘oHmeH, tInwI’ DeS 0 vIQaw','Parent product\'s threshold (%d)'=>'mIw SIQpu’ ghoS (%d)','When variation stock reaches this amount you will be notified by email. The default value for all variations can be set in the product Inventory tab. The shop default value can be set in Settings > Products > Inventory.'=>'mIw tInwI’ DeS SIQpu’ wa’logh email vIghoj. Hoch tInwI’ lut vIghro’ Inventory tabDaq vItlhutlh. Shop lut vIghro’ Settings > Products > InventoryDaq vItlhutlh.','Dimensions (L&times;W&times;H) (%s)'=>'Dimensioŋmey (L&times;W&times;H) (%s)','Length x width x height in decimal form'=>'bIQ\'a\' je Daq chenmoHbogh naQmey','Same as parent'=>'SoHvaD pagh','Enter an optional description for this variation.'=>'vaj variationDaq wej description nIvbogh chenmoH','Add file'=>'file qoH','Setup a Refund and Returns Policy page to boost your store\'s credibility.'=>'Refund \'ej Returns Policy paq tIqwIjDaq SIQpu\'bogh SIQlaH','We have created a sample draft Refund and Returns Policy page for you. Please have a look and update it to fit your store.'=>'maHvaD draft Refund \'ej Returns Policy paq nIvbogh chenmoH. jIyaj \'ej tIqwIjDaq \'oHbogh SIQlaH','Edit page'=>'paq tIqwIjDaq','Update WooCommerce Database'=>'WooCommerce Database chenmoH','Learn more about updates'=>'chenmoH neH jIyaj','WooCommerce database update required'=>'WooCommerce database chenmoH nIvbogh','WooCommerce has been updated! To keep things running smoothly, we have to update your database to the newest version.'=>'WooCommerce nIvbogh! pIj, database chenmoH neH chenmoH','The database update process runs in the background and may take a little while, so please be patient. Advanced users can alternatively update via %1$sWP CLI%2$s.'=>'database chenmoH cha\'logh neH \'ej wa\'logh pIm, vaj yIQap. \'utmo\' Dujvam vIghro\' je chenmoH %1$sWP CLI%2$s.','You can manually run queued updates here.'=>'ghItlh chenmoH neH cha\'logh','View progress →'=>'pIv chenmoH →','WooCommerce database update in progress'=>'WooCommerce database chenmoH neH','WooCommerce is updating the database in the background. The database update process may take a little while, so please be patient.'=>'WooCommerce database chenmoH neH. wa\'logh pIm, vaj yIQap','Thanks!'=>'qatlho\'','WooCommerce database update done'=>'WooCommerce database chenmoH Qap','WooCommerce database update complete. Thank you for updating to the latest version!'=>'WooCommerce database chenmoH Qap. qatlho\' chenmoH nIvbogh!','<strong>Heads up!</strong> The versions of the following plugins you\'re running haven\'t been tested with WooCommerce %s. Please update them or confirm compatibility before updating WooCommerce, or you may experience issues:'=>'<strong>yIqap!</strong> pluginmey versionmey tIqwIjDaq WooCommerce %s yIghItlh. chenmoH \'ej SIQpu\'bogh yIlo\' \'ej SIQpu\'bogh \'e\' yImev, pagh Qapla\' lo\'','unknown'=>'vIychorgh','Plugin'=>'plugin','Tested up to WooCommerce version'=>'WooCommerce version SIQpu\'bogh','The following active plugin(s) have not declared compatibility with WooCommerce %s yet and should be updated and examined further before you proceed:'=>'pluginmey QapmeH WooCommerce %s yIghItlh \'ej chenmoH yImev','Ar