' mIw vItlhutlh','Reset'=>'chu\'wI\'','Product search'=>'vamwI\' QumwI\'','Top sellers'=>'Qun chu\'choH','No products found in range'=>'vaj toDmey Qapchu\'be\'','Top freebies'=>'Qun mIw vIghro\'','Top earners'=>'Qun QavwI\'pu\'','Choose a product to view stats'=>'vamwI\' QumwI\' vIghro\' choH','Sales amount'=>'ghopDu\' mIw','No products found.'=>'Qapmey chenmoH.','View'=>'vaj','%s product'=>'%s Qap' . "\0" . '%s Qapmey','Units in stock'=>'QapmeyDaq lo\'lu\'','Rate'=>'ra\'te\'','Tax amount'=>'mIw naQ','This is the sum of the "Tax rows" tax amount within your orders.'=>'vaj "mIw mIq" mIw naQ DochmeyDaq.','Shipping tax amount'=>'raS mIw naQ','This is the sum of the "Tax rows" shipping tax amount within your orders.'=>'vaj "mIw mIq" raS mIw naQ DochmeyDaq.','Total tax'=>'mIw naQ','This is the total tax for the rate (shipping tax + product tax).'=>'vaj mIwDaq mIw naQ (raS mIw + Qap mIw).','No taxes found in this period'=>'vam poH chenmoH mIw naQ chenmoH.','Period'=>'poH','Total sales'=>'mIw Qap','This is the sum of the \'Order total\' field within your orders.'=>'vaj "Qap mIw Qap" mIw DochmeyDaq.','Total shipping'=>'mIw raS','This is the sum of the \'Shipping total\' field within your orders.'=>'vaj "raS mIw Qap" mIw DochmeyDaq.','Net profit'=>'mIw QaD','Total sales minus shipping and tax.'=>'mIw Qap raS je mIw naQ.','Totals'=>'Qapmey','Accounts &amp; Privacy'=>'lo\' & jeS','account erasure request'=>'lo\' tIr yIqaw','privacy page'=>'jeS mIw','Checkout'=>'qetlh','Enable guest checkout (recommended)'=>'naQmey qetlh (bI\'reS)','Allows customers to checkout without an account.'=>'lo\'pu\' naQmey lo\'laHbe\' lo\'.','Login'=>'chav','Enable log-in during checkout'=>'qetlhDaq chav lo\'laH','Account creation'=>'lo\' Qaw\'','After checkout (recommended)'=>'qetlh HIvje\' (bI\'reS)','Customers can create an account after their order is placed. Customize messaging %1$shere%2$s.'=>'Customerpuʼ naQmeymeyDaq chamwIʼ chenmoH; parmaqvam %1$shere%2$s.','Enable guest checkout to use this feature.'=>'Qaplaʼ ghaH nItebHaʼ vItlhutlhmeH yIloʼ.','Allow customers to create an account'=>'Customerpuʼ naQ chenmoHmeH peʼvIl yIʼegh.','During checkout'=>'Qaplaʼ poHmeyDaq','Customers can create an account before placing their order.'=>'Customerpuʼ naQ chenmoHmeH poHmeyDaq peʼvIl yIʼegh.','On "My account" page'=>'"jIH naQ" mIwDaq','Account creation options'=>'NaQ chenmoH mIw','Send password setup link (recommended)'=>'parmaq chenmoH wovbeʼ (taHqeq)','New users receive an email to set up their password.'=>'QumwIʼ chuʼnaʼ qInmeyDaq parmaq chenmoH wovbeʼ.','Enable an account creation method to use this feature.'=>'parmaq chenmoH mIw tIghmeyDaq yIloʼ.','Generate account login (recommended)'=>'parmaq wej jIʼach (taHqeq)','Generate a login for the account using first and/or last name. If neither is usable (e.g. invalid or missing) the email address will be used. If this option is unchecked, customers will need to set a username during account creation'=>'naQ chenmoH wej \'utlhmeyDaq pongmeyDaq yIloʼ. vaj wej pagh yIloʼlaHbeʼ (mIw vItlhutlhbeʼ, pagh vIqelbeʼ) qumwIʼ ghItlhmey yIloʼ. pagh mIw loʼbeʼ, customerpuʼ naQ chenmoH poHmeyDaq user pong yIʼegh.','Account erasure requests'=>'naQ chenmoH Qawtlhuʼmey','Remove personal data from orders on request'=>'QawtlhuʼmeyDaq naQ chenmoH chel','When handling an %s, should personal data within orders be retained or removed?'=>'%s QawtlhuʼmeyDaq jIjeʼmeH, naQ chenmoH chel vaj vIparHaʼʼaʼ pagh chelbeʼ?','Remove access to downloads on request'=>'QawtlhuʼmeyDaq logh downloadmeyDaq chel','When handling an %s, should access to downloadable files be revoked and download logs cleared?'=>'%s QawtlhuʼmeyDaq jIjeʼmeH, downloadmey logmey pagh chel vaj vIparHaʼʼaʼ?','Personal data removal'=>'naQ chenmoH chel','Allow personal data to be removed in bulk from orders'=>'QawtlhuʼmeyDaq naQ chenmoH chel yIloʼ','Adds an option to the orders screen for removing personal data in bulk. Note that removing personal data cannot be undone.'=>'naQ chenmoH chel yIloʼmeH QawtlhuʼmeyDaq naQ chenmoH chel yIloʼ. naQ chenmoH chel vItlhutlhbeʼ.','Privacy policy'=>'vItlhutlh Segh','This section controls the display of your website privacy policy. The privacy notices below will not show up unless a %s is set.'=>'ghItlhvamDaq qeylIS SeghmeyDaq yIloʼ. vItlhutlh Seghmey yIloʼbeʼ, vaj %s yIbaʼ.','Registration privacy policy'=>'naQ chenmoH vItlhutlh Segh','Optionally add some text about your store privacy policy to show on account registration forms.'=>'naQ chenmoH mIwDaq vItlhutlh SeghmeyDaq latlh Deʼ yIʼegh.','Your personal data will be used to support your experience throughout this website, to manage access to your account, and for other purposes described in our %s.'=>'naQ chenmoH mungmey yIloʼ, tlhoy poHmeyDaq yIloʼ, je latlh DeʼmeyDaq yIloʼ %s.','Checkout privacy policy'=>'Qaplaʼ vItlhutlh Segh','Optionally add some text about your store privacy policy to show during checkout.'=>'Qaplaʼ poHmeyDaq vItlhutlh SeghmeyDaq latlh Deʼ yIʼegh.','Your personal data will be used to process your order, support your experience throughout this website, and for other purposes described in our %s.'=>'naQ chenmoH mungmey yIloʼ, tlhoy poHmeyDaq yIloʼ, je latlh DeʼmeyDaq yIloʼ %s.','Personal data retention'=>'naQ chenmoH legh','Choose how long to retain personal data when it\'s no longer needed for processing. Leave the following options blank to retain this data indefinitely.'=>'naQ chenmoH leghmeH poH yIQaw. bIH vItlhutlhbeʼ.','Retain inactive accounts '=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey tIv','Inactive accounts are those which have not logged in, or placed an order, for the specified duration. They will be deleted. Any orders will be converted into guest orders.'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey, ghuʼvamDaq logh wejlogh vIchenmoHbeʼ, pagh QInwIʼ vItlhutlhbeʼ, chaʼlogh QInwIʼ puS loʼlaHbeʼ. vaj DeSDuʼ. Hoch QInmey DevwIʼ QInmey patlhmey je ghItlhmey loʼlaHbeʼ.','Retain pending orders '=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey tIv','Pending orders are unpaid and may have been abandoned by the customer. They will be trashed after the specified duration.'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey. vaj DeSDuʼ.','Retain failed orders'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey tIv','Failed orders are unpaid and may have been abandoned by the customer. They will be trashed after the specified duration.'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey. vaj DeSDuʼ.','Retain cancelled orders'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey tIv','Cancelled orders are unpaid and may have been cancelled by the store owner or customer. They will be trashed after the specified duration.'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey, pagh Qapbeʼ QInmey. vaj DeSDuʼ.','Retain refunded orders'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey tIv','Retain refunded orders for a specified duration before anonymizing the personal data within them.'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey.','Retain completed orders'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey tIv','Retain completed orders for a specified duration before anonymizing the personal data within them.'=>'Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey, Qapbeʼ QInmey.','This feature is only available with the Cart & Checkout blocks. %1$sLearn more%2$s.'=>'%1$sLearn more%2$s. QaStaHvIS Cart & Checkout blocks vIghro\'vam vIghor.','Your store is using shortcode checkout. Use the Checkout blocks to activate this option.'=>'SoH wIj checkout shortcode vIchenmoH. Checkout blocks vIghro\'vam vIchenmoH.','Page setup'=>'DuSaQ vItlhutlh','REST API keys'=>'REST API mIw','REST API caching'=>'REST API caching','Legacy API'=>'Legacy API','WooCommerce.com'=>'WooCommerce.com','Blueprint (beta)'=>'Blueprint (beta)','These pages need to be set so that WooCommerce knows where to send users to checkout.'=>'Qap Hoch DuSaQmey WooCommerce vIchenmoH users checkout vIlIj.','Cart page'=>'Cart DuSaQ','Page where shoppers review their shopping cart'=>'DuSaQ shoppers shopping cart vIchenmoH','Checkout page'=>'Checkout DuSaQ','Page where shoppers go to finalize their purchase'=>'DuSaQ shoppers purchase vIlIj','My account page'=>'jIH account DuSaQ','Page contents: [%s]'=>'DuSaQmey: [%s]','Terms and conditions'=>'Terms je conditions','If you define a "Terms" page the customer will be asked if they accept them when checking out.'=>'SoH "Terms" DuSaQ vIchenmoH, customer checkout vIlIj qab.','Secure checkout'=>'Secure checkout','Force secure checkout'=>'Qapchuʼ checkout','Force SSL (HTTPS) on the checkout pages (<a href="%s" target="_blank">an SSL Certificate is required</a>).'=>'Qapchuʼ SSL (HTTPS) checkout machmeyDaq (<a href="%s" target="_blank">SSL mIw chuʼ Qapchuʼ</a>).','Force HTTP when leaving the checkout'=>'checkout tIqDaq HTTP','Checkout endpoints'=>'Checkout wovbeʼmey','Endpoints are appended to your page URLs to handle specific actions during the checkout process. They should be unique.'=>'wovbeʼmey machmeyDaq URLmeyDaq jeʼluʼ checkout mIwDaq nIvbogh mIwpuʼ. Dochvam wovbeʼvam vIghroʼmey.','Pay'=>'Qap','Endpoint for the "Checkout &rarr; Pay" page.'=>'checkout &rarr; Qap machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Order received'=>'qep loʼluʼ','Endpoint for the "Checkout &rarr; Order received" page.'=>'checkout &rarr; qep loʼluʼ machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Add payment method'=>'Qap HaStaʼ mIw','Endpoint for the "Checkout &rarr; Add payment method" page.'=>'checkout &rarr; Qap HaStaʼ mIw machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Delete payment method'=>'Qap HaStaʼ mIw qaq','Endpoint for the delete payment method page.'=>'Qap HaStaʼ mIw qaq machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Set default payment method'=>'Qap HaStaʼ mIw mIw chuʼ','Endpoint for the setting a default payment method page.'=>'Qap HaStaʼ mIw mIw chuʼ machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Account endpoints'=>'Account wovbeʼmey','Endpoints are appended to your page URLs to handle specific actions on the accounts pages. They should be unique and can be left blank to disable the endpoint.'=>'wovbeʼmey machmeyDaq URLmeyDaq jeʼluʼ account machmeyDaq mIwpuʼ. Dochvam wovbeʼvam vIghroʼmey, vaj wovbeʼvam chaghmey Qul.','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Orders" page.'=>'My account &rarr; Orders machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','View order'=>'qep wIlegh','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; View order" page.'=>'My account &rarr; qep wIlegh machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Downloads" page.'=>'My account &rarr; Downloads machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Edit account'=>'account QaptaH','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Edit account" page.'=>'My account &rarr; account QaptaH machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Addresses'=>'pab','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Addresses" page.'=>'My account &rarr; pab machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Payment methods'=>'Qap HaStaʼ mIw','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Payment methods" page.'=>'My account &rarr; Qap HaStaʼ mIw machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Lost password" page.'=>'My account &rarr; pIj password machmeyDaq wovbeʼ.','Logout'=>'logDuʼ','Endpoint for the triggering logout. You can add this to your menus via a custom link: yoursite.com/?customer-logout=true'=>'logDuʼ machmeyDaq wovbeʼ. QapmeylIjDaq Qapchuʼ linkvam: yoursite.com/?customer-logout=true','WooCommerce.com Usage Tracking Documentation'=>'WooCommerce.com lo\'laHghach QIn','Usage Tracking'=>'lo\'laHghach','Gathering usage data allows us to tailor your store setup experience, offer more relevant content, and help make WooCommerce better for everyone.'=>'lo\'laHghach De\' ghochmey wIv, maS Daqmey DunmoH, yIqawvam vItlhutlh, WooCommerce vItlhapchu\' HochHom.','Enable tracking'=>'lo\'laHghach Qap','Allow usage of WooCommerce to be tracked'=>'WooCommerce lo\'laHghach lo\'laHbe\'bogh','To opt out, leave this box unticked. Your store remains untracked, and no data will be collected. Read about what usage data is tracked at: %s.'=>'choqmeH, DIvI\'vam bIrutlh vItlhutlh. Daqmey Daqmey DunmoH, \'ej De\' qeylIS Qapbe\'. lo\'laHghach De\' DunmoH \'oH: %s.','Marketplace suggestions'=>'mIwDaq mIw','We show contextual suggestions for official extensions that may be helpful to your store.'=>'maHvaD mIw mIwDaq mIwDaq mIwDaq mIw mIw mIwDaq mIwDaq mIw mIwDaq mIwDaq mIw mIwDaq mIw.','Show Suggestions'=>'mIw mIw','Display suggestions within WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerceDaq mIw mIw','Leave this box unchecked if you do not want to pull suggested extensions from WooCommerce.com.'=>'choqmeH, WooCommerce.com mIwDaq mIwDaq mIwDaq mIw mIw.','The legacy REST API is enabled'=>'leghbe\' REST API Qap','The legacy REST API is NOT enabled'=>'leghbe\' REST API Qapbe\'','ℹ️️ The WooCommerce Legacy REST API extension is installed and active.'=>'ℹ️️ WooCommerce leghbe\' REST API Qutlh \'ej Qap.','⚠️ The WooCommerce Legacy REST API has been moved to <a target=”_blank” href="%1$s">a dedicated extension</a>. <b><a target=”_blank” href="%2$s">Learn more about this change</a></b>'=>'⚠️ WooCommerce leghbe\' REST API Qutlh De\' <a target=”_blank” href="%1$s">mIw Qutlh</a>. <b><a target=”_blank” href="%2$s">chu\' mIwDaq yIqaw</a></b>','REST API response cache'=>'REST API QIn cache','These settings control backend caching and cache control headers for REST API responses.'=>'vaj cachmey backend \'ej cache QIn headers REST API QIn Qap.','Backend caching requires a WordPress object cache plugin (Redis, Memcached, etc.) to be installed and active. %1$sLearn more about object caching%2$s.'=>'backend cachmey WordPress object cache plugin (Redis, Memcached, etc.) Qap \'ej Qutlh. %1$sobject cachmey yIqaw%2$s.','Enable backend caching'=>'backend cachmey Qap','Cache REST API responses on the server'=>'serverDaq REST API QIn cachmey','Enables responses for REST API endpoints configured as cacheable. Requires an external object cache.<br/>This setting should be enabled only if no other plugins that handle caching are active.'=>'cacheable REST API QIn endpoints Qap responses. object cache Qap. cachmey Qapbe\' plugins Qapbe\'.','Enable cache control headers'=>'cache control headers Qap','Send cache control headers and support 304 Not Modified responses'=>'cache control headers Qap \'ej 304 Not Modified responses Qap','Enables including ETag and Cache-Control headers, and returning 304 Not Modified responses, for REST API endpoints configured as cacheable.'=>'ETag \'ej Cache-Control headers Qap \'ej 304 Not Modified responses Qap cacheable REST API endpoints.','Emails'=>'emailmey','Email options'=>'email mIw','To ensure your store&rsquo;s notifications arrive in your and your customers&rsquo; inboxes, we recommend connecting your email address to your domain and setting up a dedicated SMTP server. If something doesn&rsquo;t seem to be sending correctly, install the <a href="%1$s">WP Mail Logging Plugin</a> or check the <a href="%2$s">Email FAQ page</a>.'=>'Daqmey lo\'laHghach vItlhutlh, mIw email joHpu\' je lo\'laHghach, mIw SMTP server Qap. Qapbe\' \'e\' neH, <a href="%1$s">WP Mail Logging Plugin</a> lo\' \'ej <a href="%2$s">Email FAQ page</a> yIqaw.','Email notifications sent from WooCommerce are listed below. Click on an email to configure it.<br>%s'=>'WooCommerceDaq email notifications yIqaw. emailDaq click yIqaw.<br>%s','Email notifications'=>'email notifications','Email sender options'=>'email joHpu\' mIw','Set the name and email address you\'d like your outgoing emails to use.'=>'pongwIj tIvjaj \'ej email chenmoHbogh pong chenmoHmeH.','"From" name'=>'"pong" pong','"From" address'=>'"pong" chenmoH','Add "Reply-to" email'=>'"ghItlh" email chenmoH','Add a different email address to receive replies.'=>'ghItlhmey vItlhutlhbogh email chenmoH chenmoH.','"Reply-to" name'=>'"ghItlh" pong','"Reply-to" address'=>'"ghItlh" chenmoH','Email template'=>'Email template','Customize your WooCommerce email template and preview it below.'=>'WooCommerce email template chenmoH \'ej qaSpu\' pa\' logh preview.','Try new templates'=>'template chu\' chel','Logo'=>'logo','Add your logo to each of your WooCommerce emails. If no logo is uploaded, your site title will be used instead.'=>'WooCommerce email pongmey logo chu\' chel. logo mach, site pong yImev.','Logo width (px)'=>'Logo mIw (px)','Header alignment'=>'Header De\'bej','Left'=>'wIgh','Center'=>'mIw','Right'=>'bIr','Font family'=>'rItlh family','Footer text'=>'Footer Hol','This text will appear in the footer of all of your WooCommerce emails.'=>'vaj Hol Hoch WooCommerce emailmey footerDaq yImev.','Available placeholders: %s'=>'Available placeholders: %s','Color palette'=>'color palette','Accent'=>'Accent','Customize the color of your buttons and links. Default %s.'=>'buttons \'ej links color chenmoH. mIw Default %s.','Email background'=>'email background','Select a color for the background of your emails. Default %s.'=>'email background color chenmoH. mIw Default %s.','Content background'=>'content background','Choose a background color for the content area of your emails. Default %s.'=>'content background color chenmoH. mIw Default %s.','Heading & text'=>'heading & text','Set the color of your headings and text. Default %s.'=>'headings \'ej text color chenmoH. mIw Default %s.','Secondary text'=>'cha\'logh mIw','Choose a color for your secondary text, such as your footer content. Default %s.'=>'cha\'logh mIw color vIqel, footer DaqmeylIjDaq. Default %s.','Auto-sync with theme'=>'theme vIghro\' Sync','Automatically update email styles when theme styles change'=>'theme mIw Hochmey vIghro\' email mIw vIwIv','Email improvements button'=>'email Daqmey Qap button','Content type'=>'Daqmey tIn','Recipient(s)'=>'poS recipient','Customer'=>'qay\'','<b>Cc</b>: %s'=>'<b>Cc</b>: %s','<b>Bcc</b>: %s'=>'<b>Bcc</b>: %s','<b>To</b>: %s'=>'<b>To</b>: %s','Manually sent'=>'manual QI\'yaH','Manual'=>'manual','Disabled'=>'nIvbogh','Manage'=>'vIQoy','Loading&hellip;'=>'vItlhutlh&hellip;','Email preview'=>'email mIch','Preview your email template. You can also test on different devices and send yourself a test email.'=>'email template mIch. Qapchu\'vam yIpoS, mIwDaq Qap, QI\'yaH email tIqwIj yIghoS.','Standard fonts'=>'standard fontmey','Custom fonts'=>'custom fontmey','Sync with theme'=>'theme vIghro\' Sync','Previewing new template designs. You can customize and test your emails and switch to the new template whenever you are ready.'=>'template Qapmey mIch. emailmey yIghoS, Qap, template Daq mIw Daq.','Switch to new template'=>'template Daq mIw vIghro\'','Keep legacy template'=>'legacy template Qoch','Try our new email templates!'=>'email template Qapmey wIv!','Are you sure want to revert to legacy? Doing so will erase any changes you’ve made to your new email templates, and will restore your previous email designs.'=>'legacy template vItlhutlh? template Daqmey chIm, email template tIQaw.','Revert to legacy template'=>'legacy template vItlhutlh','Suggest full addresses to customers as they type.'=>'customer address mIw wIvlu\'.','Requires a plugin with predictive address search support (e.g. <a href="%s" target="_blank">WooPayments</a>).'=>'predictive address search Qap plugin vIwIv (e.g. <a href="%s" target="_blank">WooPayments</a>).','Enable predictive address search'=>'predictive address search vIqel','Address autocomplete'=>'baS tlhutlh','Preferred address autocomplete provider'=>'choH baS tlhutlh DujwIj','Store Address'=>'DujwI’ baS','This is where your business is located. Tax rates and shipping rates will use this address.'=>'vaj DuQ Daq DochwIj Daq jImej. mIwjaj je mIwDajvam baS vItlhutlh.','The street address for your business location.'=>'DujwIj Daq baS pa’ mIw.