cal address'=>'bIQ\'a\' mIw chenmoH','Phone number'=>'ghobe\' loQ','Your store contact email.'=>'SoHvaD contact email.','Refund & Returns Policy'=>'Qap & chavmoHwI\' SeHlaw','Brief statement that will appear on the receipts.'=>'QawHaq vIghro\' \'ej receiptmeyDaq yaj.','Shop pages'=>'SoHvaD mIw','Shop page'=>'SoHvaD mIw','The base page can also be used in your <a href="%s">product permalinks</a>.'=>'bIraqlu\'taH mIw <a href="%s">product permalinks</a>Daq jImej.','This sets the base page of your shop - this is where your product archive will be.'=>'SoHvaD mIw Dunmo\' vIghro\' - product archiveDaq DaqaSmoH.','Add to cart behaviour'=>'cartDaq yItlhutlh','Redirect to the cart page after successful addition'=>'yItlhutlh cart mIwDaq tlhegh vIvoqmeyDaq yIbuS','Enable AJAX add to cart buttons on archives'=>'archiveDaq AJAX cart yItlhutlh buttons jom','Placeholder image'=>'Placeholder mIch','Enter attachment ID or URL to an image'=>'attachment ID pagh mIch URL qet','This is the attachment ID, or image URL, used for placeholder images in the product catalog. Products with no image will use this.'=>'mIch pagh attachment ID, product catalog placeholder mIchDaq vIlo\'laH. mIch qeylISmey vIlo\'laH.','Measurements'=>'QeDmey','Weight unit'=>'QeD qaStaHvIS','This controls what unit you will define weights in.'=>'QeDmeyDaq qaStaHvIS unit vIQoy','Dimensions unit'=>'taH QeD','This controls what unit you will define lengths in.'=>'taH vIQoy unit','Enable product reviews'=>'product reviewmey jom','Show "verified owner" label on customer reviews'=>'customer reviewmeyDaq "verified owner" label yIqaw','Reviews can only be left by "verified owners"'=>'reviewmey "verified owner" neH','Product ratings'=>'product ratingmey','Enable star rating on reviews'=>'reviewmeyDaq star rating jom','Star ratings should be required, not optional'=>'star ratingmey vIvoqHa\'be\' \'ach req','Manage stock'=>'stock ghoS','Enable stock management'=>'stock ghoS jom','Hold stock (minutes)'=>'stock ghoS (Daqmey)','Hold stock (for unpaid orders) for x minutes. When this limit is reached, the pending order will be cancelled. Leave blank to disable.'=>'stock ghoS (unpaid orders) x Daqmey. limitDaq DaqaSmoH, pending order vItlhutlh. qIj vIlo\'Ha\'be\'.','Notifications'=>'chu\' notifications','Enable low stock notifications'=>'low stock notifications jom','Enable out of stock notifications'=>'quvHa\' neH lo\'taHghach Qap','Notification recipient(s)'=>'Qap ngevwI\'pu\'','Enter recipients (comma separated) that will receive this notification.'=>'Qap ngevwI\'pu\' (cha\'logh qaw\' pagh) wej ngevwI\'pu\' vIchenmoH.','When product stock reaches this amount you will be notified via email.'=>'po\'wI\' neH Qap \'oH cha\'loghjaj Hoch DaqaSmoHmeH.','Out of stock threshold'=>'quvHa\' neH jegh','When product stock reaches this amount the stock status will change to "out of stock" and you will be notified via email. This setting does not affect existing "in stock" products.'=>'po\'wI\' neH Qap \'oH cha\'loghjaj Hoch DaqaSmoHmeH \'ej quvHa\' neH vItlhutlhmeH. \'oH qanobmey \'oH \'in Qap\' lo\'taHghachmey neH vItlhutlhbe\'.','Out of stock visibility'=>'quvHa\' neH Qap chu\' visibility','Hide out of stock items from the catalog'=>'quvHa\' neH pagh lo\'taHghachmey catalogDaq vIghro\'','Stock display format'=>'Qap tIqwIj tlhuH','This controls how stock quantities are displayed on the frontend.'=>'vaj Qap Qapmey yIlo\' frontendDaq.','Always show quantity remaining in stock e.g. "12 in stock"'=>'DaH vIlo\'be\' Qap cha\'logh \'e\' yImev, e.g. "cha\'logh 12 Qap"','Only show quantity remaining in stock when low e.g. "Only 2 left in stock"'=>'DaH vIlo\'be\' Qap cha\'logh \'e\' yImev, Qap cha\'logh \'e\' vIlo\'be\' e.g. "cha\'logh 2 neH Qap"','Never show quantity remaining in stock'=>'Qap cha\'logh \'e\' yImevbe\' DaH','File download method'=>'qap file download mIw','Forcing downloads will keep URLs hidden, but some servers may serve large files unreliably. If supported, %1$s / %2$s can be used to serve downloads instead (server requires %3$s).'=>'mIw download latlhlu\'pu\' URLmey vIghIj, \'ach QeDmey \'oH vIghro\' \'ej lugh vItlhutlh. vaj, %1$s / %2$s \'oH download Qapchu\' vItlhutlhmeH (server %3$s vIghro\').','If you are using X-Accel-Redirect download method along with NGINX server, make sure that you have applied settings as described in <a href=\'%s\'>Digital/Downloadable Product Handling</a> guide.'=>'NGINX server je X-Accel-Redirect download mIw yIlo\' \'e\' vIneH, vaj DaqaS \'oH settings yIlo\' <a href=\'%s\'>Digital/Downloadable Product Handling</a> guideDaq.','Force downloads'=>'download latlhlu\'','X-Accel-Redirect/X-Sendfile'=>'X-Accel-Redirect/X-Sendfile','Redirect only'=>'tlhoy redirect','Redirect only (Insecure)'=>'tlhoy redirect (QIt)','Allow using redirect mode (insecure) as a last resort'=>'redirect mIw yIlo\' QIt chu\' mIw','If the "Force Downloads" or "X-Accel-Redirect/X-Sendfile" download method is selected but does not work, the system will use the "Redirect" method as a last resort. <a href="%1$s">See this guide</a> for more details.'=>'"download latlhlu\'" pagh "X-Accel-Redirect/X-Sendfile" mIw yIlo\' \'ach lughbe\' vaj \'oH "redirect" mIw QIt chu\' mIw. <a href="%1$s">vaj tlhoy guide</a>.','Access restriction'=>'Qap Qutlh','Downloads require login'=>'download \'oH yIDIl login','This setting does not apply to guest purchases.'=>'vaj setting Qap guest purchasemeyDaq yIlo\'be\'.','Grant access to downloadable products after payment'=>'payment vagh downloadable products Qap access','Enable this option to grant access to downloads when orders are "processing", rather than "completed".'=>'vaj mIw yIlo\' download access orders "processing" Daq yIlo\' "completed".','Open in browser'=>'browserDaq bIDa','Open downloadable files in the browser, instead of saving them to the device.'=>'downloadable file browserDaq bIDa, deviceDaq vItlhutlhbe\'.','Customers can still save the file to their device, but by default file will be opened instead of being downloaded (does not work with redirects).'=>'customers file deviceDaq vItlhutlh, \'ach file wIlo\' browserDaq be\'natlh (redirect mIw lughbe\').','Filename'=>'pongwIj','Append a unique string to filename for security'=>'pongwIjDaq mIw vItlhutlhbogh Qapchu’ string ’oH begh','Not required if your download directory is protected. <a href=\'%s\'>See this guide</a> for more details. Files already uploaded will not be affected.'=>'tlhaqbejbe’ vaj je chu’ mIwDaq QawHaq. <a href=\'%s\'>mIw’e’ QumwI’</a> ’e’ naQmey vItlhutlh. De’wI’ pImDaq naQmey Qapchu’bejbe’.','Count partial downloads'=>'puS mIw tIq','Count downloads even if only part of a file is fetched.'=>'puS mIw tIq vaj begh tIqtaHbogh mIwDaq.','Repeat fetches made within a reasonable window of time (by default, 30 minutes) will not be counted twice. This is a generally reasonably way to enforce download limits in relation to ranged requests. %1$sLearn more.%2$s'=>'','Shipping zones'=>'qoq chu’','Shipping settings'=>'qoq rurbogh','Classes'=>'Hoch','Shipping providers'=>'qoq Suqmey','Calculations'=>'Qutlhmey','Enable the shipping calculator on the cart page'=>'qoq Qutlh rurbogh vItlhutlhbe’ cartDaq','Hide shipping costs until an address is entered'=>'qoq nIQmey vItlhutlhbe’ vaj cha’logh ’e’ wej','Hide shipping rates when free shipping is available'=>'qoq tlha’ ’e’ qogh qaSbogh qoq nIQmey vItlhutlhbe’','Shipping destination'=>'qoq yItlhutlh','This controls which shipping address is used by default.'=>'DaHjaj qoq yItlhutlh vIqawchu’ ’e’ jIpawn.','Default to customer shipping address'=>'customer qoq yItlhutlh vIqawchu’','Default to customer billing address'=>'customer billing yItlhutlh vIqawchu’','Force shipping to the customer billing address'=>'customer billing yItlhutlh vIqawchu’','Debug mode'=>'Qap mode','Enable debug mode'=>'Qap mode vItlhutlh','Enable shipping debug mode to show matching shipping zones and to bypass shipping rate cache.'=>'qoq Qap mode vItlhutlh ’e’ vItlhutlhchu’ qoq qoqmey vIqawchu’ je qoq rate cache vIt