ate for your base location (%1$s). Please %2$sconfigure standard tax rates%3$s to ensure accurate tax calculations.'=>'SoH "mIghvam mIw je" Qapla\' \'ach veS chutmey (%1$s) pIm qej mIghvam Qapchu\'be\'. %2$sqej mIghvam Qapchu\' mIw%3$s lo\'laHghach vItlhutlh.','Shipping classes'=>'HIvje\'ghach mIw','Add shipping class'=>'HIvje\'ghach mIw qeylIS','Use shipping classes to customize the shipping rates for different groups of products, such as heavy items that require higher postage fees.'=>'HIvje\'ghach mIw lo\'laHghach HIvje\'ghach mIw qejmey Qapchu\' mIw \'e\' mIw qejmey lo\'laHghach, rur \'ej Heghmey tIqDaq poStaHmey QaD.','No shipping classes have been created.'=>'HIvje\'ghach mIw lo\'laHbe\'.','Close modal panel'=>'mIw mach He\' Daq','e.g. Heavy'=>'vaj. Heghmey','Give your shipping class a name for easy identification'=>'HIvje\'ghach mIw pong qel vItlhutlh','e.g. heavy-packages'=>'naDev heavy-packages','Slug (unique identifier) can be left blank and auto-generated, or you can enter one'=>'Slug (tugh ghom) tIn mIghDaq wovbe\' je, \'ach bImej \'ej auto-generated, pagh wa\' wej.','e.g. For heavy items requiring higher postage'=>'naDev heavy mI\'mey mIw vI\'ovta\' pagh poH je tlhejpa\'','Add shipping provider'=>'shipping provider qoD','Add custom shipping providers so they appear in the fulfillment form when creating shipments. Use the tracking URL template to auto-generate tracking links.'=>'custom shipping providers qoD, vaj chaH fulfillment form Daq shipments vIqaw. Tracking URL template lo\' tracking links auto-generate.','No custom shipping providers have been created.'=>'custom shipping providers chenmoHbe\'','e.g. My Local Courier'=>'naDev My Local Courier','The display name for this shipping provider.'=>'Daj shipping provider pong.','e.g. my-local-courier'=>'naDev my-local-courier','Unique identifier (auto-generated if left blank).'=>'tugh ghom (auto-generated wa\' wej bImej).','e.g. https://example.com/track?id=__PLACEHOLDER__'=>'naDev https://example.com/track?id=__PLACEHOLDER__','Use __PLACEHOLDER__ where the tracking number should appear in the URL.'=>'Use __PLACEHOLDER__ tracking number URL Daq vIqaw.','e.g. https://example.com/icon.png'=>'naDev https://example.com/icon.png','Optional URL for the provider icon.'=>'provider icon optional URL.','Add zone'=>'zone qoD','Return to shipping'=>'shipping QoQvaD tlhoS','Zone name'=>'zone pong','Give your zone a name! E.g. Local, or Worldwide.'=>'zone pong pong! naDev Local, pagh Worldwide.','Zone regions'=>'zone regions','List the regions you\'d like to include in your shipping zone. Customers will be matched against these regions.'=>'regions vItlhutlh vItlhutlh shipping zone Daq. Customers regions vItlhutlh.','Limit to specific ZIP/postcodes'=>'ZIP/postcodes pup','List 1 postcode per line'=>'1 postcode pagh logh','Postcodes containing wildcards (e.g. CB23*) or fully numeric ranges (e.g. <code>90210...99000</code>) are also supported. Please see the shipping zones <a href="%s" target="_blank">documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Postcodes wildcards (naDev CB23*) pagh fully numeric ranges (naDev <code>90210...99000</code>) vItlhutlh. Shipping zones <a href="%s" target="_blank">documentation</a> vIqaw.','Shipping methods'=>'Shipping methods','Add the shipping methods you\'d like to make available to customers in this zone.'=>'shipping methods customers zone lo\' vIqaw.','Add shipping method'=>'shipping method qoD','You can add multiple shipping methods within this zone. Only customers within the zone will see them.'=>'shipping methods zone Daq qoD. Customers zone lo\' mIq vI\'ov.','Set up %s'=>'Set up %s','Add shipping class costs'=>'shipping class costs qoD','Back'=>'tugh','Create and save'=>'qar\'a\' \'ej tIn','STEP 2 OF 2'=>'DACH 2 -DACH 2','Create shipping method'=>'ghItlh je tIn wIv','Choose the shipping method you wish to add. Only shipping methods which support zones are listed.'=>'ghItlh wIv \'ej wIv \'oHmeyDaq wIv wIv machmeyDaj choH. zones tIghmey vItlhutlh.','