uvwI\'vam checkout mIwDaq DaneH vIqel.','What we collect and store'=>'nuq vIqel \'ej vIghaj','While you visit our site, we’ll track:'=>'maH SuvwI\'vam Daq tlhutlh, maH HIq vIqel:','Products you’ve viewed: we’ll use this to, for example, show you products you’ve recently viewed'=>'maH tlhutlh Sojpu\': maH tlhutlh Sojpu\' vIlo\' \'ej vIghaj','Location, IP address and browser type: we’ll use this for purposes like estimating taxes and shipping'=>'Daq, IP Daq je browser mIw: maH vIlo\' \'ej vItu\' vay\' like taxmey je je\' Qapchu\'','Shipping address: we’ll ask you to enter this so we can, for instance, estimate shipping before you place an order, and send you the order!'=>'SIchpotlh vIghro’: wIlo’qa’meH, vaj yIqaw, quvHa’ghach vIghro’ tIqwIjDaq yIqaw, ‘ej SoHvaD tIqwIjDaq vIghro’ DuQ!','We’ll also use cookies to keep track of cart contents while you’re browsing our site.'=>'mIw wIghro’mo’, wa’logh Suvbogh cart mIw chenmoHmeH, nIvbogh wa’logh website wIleghbe’. ','Note: you may want to further detail your cookie policy, and link to that section from here.'=>'QIn: cookie Qu’meyvetlhDaq ghu’vam chenchoHlaH, ‘ej [link]vamDaq link vIlegh.','When you purchase from us, we’ll ask you to provide information including your name, billing address, shipping address, email address, phone number, credit card/payment details and optional account information like username and password. We’ll use this information for purposes, such as, to:'=>'SoHvaD maj, nIvbogh chenmoHmeH, pong, tIqwIj, SIchpotlh vIghro’, email, ghotpu’ telefon, credit card/mIw details ‘ej optional account Qu’mey vIghro’, username ‘ej password pong. mIw vIlo’meH, vaj:','Send you information about your account and order'=>'SoHvaD account ‘ej tIqwIjDaq Qu’mey vItlhutlh','Respond to your requests, including refunds and complaints'=>'SoHvaD DaHjaj, reHvo’ghom ‘ej HarghmeyDaq QInmey','Process payments and prevent fraud'=>'mIw wo’moH ‘ej DeQmey HaSta’','Set up your account for our store'=>'SoHvaD account wIghro’meH','Comply 