'PayPal Buttons'=>'PayPal Buttons','Enable PayPal Buttons'=>'PayPal Buttons vIqaw','Enable PayPal buttons to offer PayPal, Venmo and Pay Later as express checkout options on product, cart, and checkout pages.'=>'PayPal, Venmo \'ej Pay Later vIje\'ghach express checkout mIw vIje\'ghach PayPal buttons vIqaw.','Invoice prefix'=>'Invoice prefix','Please enter a prefix for your invoice numbers. If you use your PayPal account for multiple stores ensure this prefix is unique as PayPal will not allow orders with the same invoice number.'=>'Invoice numbers vIje\'ghach prefix vIje\'ghach. PayPal account multiple stores vIje\'ghach, prefix vIje\'ghach unique PayPal naQmey invoice number vIpoSbe\'.','Shipping details'=>'Shipping details','Send shipping details to PayPal instead of billing.'=>'PayPal vIje\'ghach shipping details vItlhutlh billing vay\'','PayPal allows us to send one address. If you are using PayPal for shipping labels you may prefer to send the shipping address rather than billing. Turning this option off may prevent PayPal Seller protection from applying.'=>'PayPal wa\' address vItlhutlh. shipping labels PayPal vIje\'ghach, shipping address vItlhutlh billing vItlhutlh. option vIchoHbe\' PayPal Seller protection vIghItlh.','Address override'=>'ghItlhwI\' mIw','Prevent buyers from changing the shipping address.'=>'mIw ghoSghach vIghro\'pu\' qaSlu\'ghach Qapchu\'ghach vItlhutlh.','When enabled, PayPal will use the address provided by the checkout form, and prevent the buyer from changing it inside the PayPal payment page. Disable this to let buyers choose a shipping address from their PayPal account. PayPal verifies addresses therefore this setting can cause errors (we recommend keeping it disabled).'=>'vaj QaptaH, PayPal mIw ghItlhwI\' mIw mIwDaq \'ej vIghro\'pu\' mIw PayPal mIw nIvbogh mIw vItlhutlh. Qapchu\'ghach vItlhutlh pagh vIghro\'pu\' mIw PayPal mIwDaq vItlhutlh. PayPal mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw mIw.','Debug log'=>'Qaplog Qap','Enable logging'=>'Qaplog Qap','Log PayPal events such as IPN requests and review them on the <a href="%s">Logs screen</a>. Note: this may log personal information. We recommend using this for debugging purposes only and deleting the logs when finished.'=>'PayPal mIwmey, IPN DaHjajmey je log pIj <a href="%s">log ngoq</a>Daq. Qapchu\'law\' \'oH vItlhutlhmeH. Qapchu\'ghachvam \'oH vItlhutlhmeH \'ej logmey wej yImev.','Image url'=>'nagh URL','Optionally enter the URL to a 150x50px image displayed as your logo in the upper left corner of the PayPal checkout pages.'=>'150x50px nagh URL vItlhutlhmeH, PayPal checkout Daq chep logoDaq tIj tInDaq yImev.','IPN email notifications'=>'IPN email qaStaHvIS','Enable IPN email notifications'=>'IPN email qaStaHvIS yIlo\'','Send notifications when an IPN is received from PayPal indicating refunds, chargebacks and cancellations.'=>'PayPalDaq IPN ghoS \'ej qay\'lu\'pu\' refund, chargeback, je cancel vIghItlh.','Receiver email'=>'pab receiver email','If your main PayPal email differs from the PayPal email entered above, input your main receiver email for your PayPal account here. This is used to validate IPN requests.'=>'PayPal email lo\'laHbe\' wa\'DIch emailDaq receiver email vIlo\' SoH. IPN ghoS mIw vIlo\'.','PayPal identity token'=>'PayPal jup patlh token','Optionally enable "Payment Data Transfer" (Profile > Profile and Settings > My Selling Tools > Website Preferences) and then copy your identity token here. This will allow payments to be verified without the need for PayPal IPN.'=>'Payment Data Transfer (Profile > Profile and Settings > My Selling Tools > Website Preferences) yIlo\' \'ej token vIghItlh. PayPal IPN chenmoHtaH \'e\' yIlo\'.','API credentials'=>'API ngoghmey','Enter your PayPal API credentials to process refunds via PayPal. Learn how to access your <a href="%s">PayPal API Credentials</a>.'=>'PayPal API ngoghmey vIlo\' refundmey PayPalDaq vIghItlh. <a href="%s">PayPal API ngoghmey</a> vIghItlh.','Li