er base.'=>'Affirm Buy Now Pay Later mIwmey tIqDaq nIvbogh, mIw tIqDaq ghItlh, QeDmey nIv, je maH lughaj.','Afterpay'=>'Afterpay','Afterpay allows customers to receive products immediately and pay for purchases over four installments, always interest-free.'=>'Afterpay nIvbogh QeDmey DaqaSlaHghachmey, loS wej HeghmeH QeDmey tIqDaq pagh interest.','Airwallex Payments'=>'Airwallex QeDmey','Boost international sales and save on FX fees. Accept 60+ local payment methods including Apple Pay and Google Pay.'=>'qeylIS QeDmey vIghItlh je FX fees wIghItlh. 60+ local QeDmey, Apple Pay je Google Pay lo\'lu\'','Amazon Pay'=>'Amazon QeDmey','Enable a familiar, fast checkout for hundreds of millions of active Amazon customers globally.'=>'Qun Amazon QeDmey vIlo\'lu\' je mIw nIvbogh.','Take payments via bank transfer.'=>'bank transfer lo\'lu\' QeDmey','Take payments in cash upon delivery.'=>'delivery poH QeDmey pagh lo\'lu\'','Eway'=>'Eway','The Eway extension for WooCommerce allows you to take credit card payments directly on your store without redirecting your customers to a third party site to make payment.'=>'WooCommerce Eway wIv Dalo’ SoH je’ credit card to’lu’pu’ pa’ toQDujDaq qo’meylIjDaq lugh payment pagh third party ghomDaq payment ngoQtaHmey.','Klarna Checkout'=>'Klarna Checkout','Choose the payment that you want, pay now, pay later or slice it. No credit card numbers, no passwords, no worries.'=>'paymey choHmeH, DaH pay, poH pay pagh slice. credit card patlhmey, passwordmey, QubHa’meH Qapchu’.','Klarna Payments'=>'Klarna Payments','Mollie'=>'Mollie','Effortless payments by Mollie: Offer global and local payment methods, get onboarded in minutes, and supported in your language.'=>'Mollie lo’ paymentmey: tera’Daq je nIvbogh payment patlhmey, tup vIlopQo’ jay’ cha’logh, je HolwIjDaq bIjatlh.','Payfast'=>'Payfast','The Payfast extension for WooCommerce enables you to accept payments by Credit Card and EFT via one of South Africa’s most popular payment gateways. No setup fees or monthly subscription costs. Selecting this extension will configure your store to use South African rands as the selected currency.'=>'WooCommerce Payfast wIv Dalo’ SoH credit card je EFT paymentmey South Africa Daq payment gatewaymeyDaq. Setup QaptaHvIS pagh jar subscription. wIv choHmey storeDaq South African rands currencyvam.','Payoneer Checkout'=>'Payoneer Checkout','Payoneer Checkout is the next generation of payment processing platforms, giving merchants around the world the solutions and direction they need to succeed in today’s hyper-competitive global market.'=>'Payoneer Checkout wIv Dalo’ SoH qImroq payment processing platformmey, tera’Daq Dujmey Qapchu’ je tIjwI’.','Paystack'=>'Paystack','Paystack helps African merchants accept one-time and recurring payments online with a modern, safe, and secure payment gateway.'=>'Paystack lo’ paymentmey African Dujmey online je, nIvbogh, Qapchu’ payment gateway.','PayU for WooCommerce'=>'PayU for WooCommerce','Enable PayU’s exclusive plugin for WooCommerce to start accepting payments in 100+ payment methods available in India including credit cards, debit cards, UPI, & more!'=>'PayU plugin WooCommerce Daq pe’vIlmey 100+ payment patlhmey IndiaDaq credit card, debit card, UPI je latlhmey lo’.','PayPal Payments'=>'PayPal Payments','Safe and secure payments using credit cards or your customer\'s PayPal account.'=>'Qapchu’ je SuvwI’ payments credit card pagh PayPal accountDaq.','Razorpay'=>'Razorpay','The official Razorpay extension for WooCommerce allows you to accept credit cards, debit cards, netbanking, wallet, and UPI payments.'=>'Razorpay WooCommerce wIv Dalo’ SoH credit card, debit card, netbanking, wallet, je UPI paymentmey lo’.','Square'=>'Square','Securely accept credit and debit cards with one low rate, no surprise fees (custom rates available). Sell online and in store and track sales and inventory in one place.'=>'credit je debit cardmey Qapchu’ lo’ rate, pagh surprise fees (custom rates). online je storeDaq sale je inventory track.',' Stripe'=>'Stripe','Accept debit and credit cards in 135+ currencies, methods such as Alipay, and one-touch checkout with Apple Pay.'=>'135+ currencies, Alipay je Apple Pay one-touch checkoutDaq debit je credit card lo’.','Mercado Pago'=>'Mercado Pago','Set up your payment methods and accept credit and debit cards, cash, bank transfers and money from your Mercado Pago account. Offer safe and secure payments with Latin America’s leading processor.'=>'payment patlhmey setup, credit, debit card, cash, bank transfer je Mercado Pago accountDaq money lo’. Latin America leading processor Qapchu’ payments.','WooPayments'=>'WooPayments','Manage transactions without leaving your WordPress Dashboard. Only with WooPayments.'=>'transactionmey WordPress DashboardDaq lugh manage. WooPayments vIghro’.','With WooPayments, you can securely accept major cards, Apple Pay, and payments in over 100 currencies. Track cash flow and manage recurring revenue directly from your store’s dashboard - with no setup costs or monthly fees.'=>'WooPayments lo’ major cardmey, Apple Pay, je 100 currencies paymentmey Qapchu’. cash flow track, recurring revenue storeDaq dashboardDaq manage. pagh setup pagh jar.','With WooPayments, you can securely accept major cards, Apple Pay, and payments in over 100 currencies – with no setup costs or monthly fees – and you can now accept in-person payments with the Woo mobile app.'=>'WooPayments lo’ major cardmey, Apple Pay, 100 currencies paymentmey Qapchu’ – pagh setup pagh jar – Woo mobile appDaq in-person paymentmey lo’.','Activate BNPL instantly on WooPayments'=>'BNPL WooPaymentsDaq tupchu’ je','The world’s favorite buy now, pay later options and many more are right at your fingertips with WooPayments — all from one dashboard, without needing multiple extensions and logins.'=>'qo’meywIj yInwIjDaq DaH jImej, Qapchu’ pay later mIwmey je latlh law’ WooPayments ‘ej — Hoch wa’ dashboardDaq, logh Hochmey extensions je logins chavmeymey yIlo’be’.','Zip Co - Buy Now, Pay Later'=>'Zip Co - jImej, pay later','Give your customers the power to pay later, interest free and watch your sales grow.'=>'SuSmoHchu’ customermeylIj pay later, interest lo’laHbe’ ‘ej SuStelwIj Som.','%s connected successfully'=>'%s Dochmey ghomtaHvIS','Standard product'=>'Standard product','A single physical or virtual product, e.g. a t-shirt or an eBook.'=>'wa’ physical pagh virtual product,  e.g. t-shirt pagh eBook.','A set of products that go well together, e.g. camera kit.'=>'productmey chu’vam vIghro’ ‘ej vItlhutlh, e.g. camera kit.','Affiliate product'=>'Affiliate product','A link to a product sold on a different website, e.g. brand collab.'=>'product link vItlhutlh different websiteDaq, e.g. brand collab.','The metaboxhidden_product meta from the user metas.'=>'metaboxhidden_product meta user metasDaq.','All Products ( new )'=>'All Products ( chu’ )','Save time'=>'poH Segh','Automatically import order information to quickly print your labels.'=>'Automatically import order De’ vIta’ vIghaj print labels.','Save money'=>'Soj Segh','Shop for the best shipping rates, and access pre-negotiated discounted rates.'=>'Shop best shipping rates, ‘ej access pre-negotiated discounted rates.','Wow your shoppers'=>'Wow shopperslIj','Keep your customers informed with tracking notifications.'=>'customerlIj loQ tracking notifications vItlhutlh.','Powerful yet easy-to-use solution:'=>'Qapchu’ ‘ej easy-to-use solution:','Discounted labels from top global carriers'=>'Discounted labels top global carriers','Sync all your selling channels in one place'=>'Sync Hoch selling channels wa’Daq','Advanced automated workflows and customs'=>'Advanced automated workflows je customs','Instantly send tracking to your customers'=>'Instantly tracking yImev customerlIj','30-day free trial'=>'30-day free trial','Simplified shipping with: '=>'Simplified shipping with: ','Highly discounted shipping rates'=>'Highly discounted shipping rates','Seamless order sync and 