</strong> poQ. <a href="%2$s">taH</a> updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.','Review subscriptions'=>'subscriptionmey tIq','You don\'t have a subscription for <strong>%1$s</strong>. Subscribe to receive updates and streamlined support.'=>'SoH subscription \'oHbe\' <strong>%1$s</strong>. jol updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.','You don\'t have subscriptions for <strong>%1$s Woo extensions</strong>. Subscribe to receive updates and streamlined support.'=>'SoH subscriptionmey \'oHbe\' <strong>%1$s Woo extensionmey</strong>. jol updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.','Successfully disconnected from <b>%1$s</b>.'=>'Qapchu\' jImej <b>%1$s</b>.','Successfully connected to <b>%s</b>.'=>'Qapchu\' jImej <b>%s</b>.','Your WooCommerce extension subscription is missing a payment method for renewal. <a href="%s">Add a payment method</a> to ensure you continue receiving updates and streamlined support.'=>'WooCommerce extension subscription SoH payment method Qapbe\' taHmey. <a href="%s">payment method chu\'</a> updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.' . "\0" . 'WooCommerce extension subscriptionmey SoH payment method Qapbe\' taHmey. <a href="%s">payment method chu\'</a> updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.','Your WooCommerce extension subscription is missing a payment method for renewal. Add a payment method to ensure you continue receiving updates and streamlined support.'=>'WooCommerce extension subscription SoH payment method Qapbe\' taHmey. payment method chu\' updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.' . "\0" . 'WooCommerce extension subscriptionmey SoH payment method Qapbe\' taHmey. payment method chu\' updates je QavwI\' tIqDaq.','Refresh Remote Inbox Notifications'=>'Remote Inbox Notifications Sov','Refresh'=>'Sov','This will refresh the remote inbox notifications'=>'vaj remote inbox notifications Sov','Remote inbox notifications have been refreshed'=>'Remote inbox notifications Sov','Delete an Inbox Notification'=>'Inbox Notification Qaw\'','This will delete an inbox notification by slug'=>'vaj inbox notification Qaw\' by slug','Select an