y filtering the file list before searching.'=>'⚠️ waʼlogh %s mIw yIloʼ. mIw QInDaq yIloʼ yIqel.','Logs settings'=>'log Settings','Logger'=>'logwI\'','File system (default)'=>'choHmey Segh (motlh)','Database (not recommended on live sites)'=>'QumwI\' (vaj nuqneH vItlhutlhbogh mIw)','Note that if this setting is changed, any log entries that have already been recorded will remain stored in their current location, but will not migrate.'=>'vaj mIw vItlhutlhbogh neH, log wejpu\' vItlhutlhbogh mIwpu\' Hoch logpu\' DaqmeyDaq Qapchu\' \'e\' DaSov, \'ach Qapchu\' Hoch logpu\' naQmeyDaq Qapchu\' \'e\' DaDaq.','This setting cannot be changed here because it is defined in the %s constant.'=>'vaj %s constantDaq wIvbeʼ, vaj tlhapbeʼ.','Log storage'=>'log chenmoH','This determines where log entries are saved.'=>'vaj log wejpu\' Daq chenmoH','This setting cannot be changed here because it is being set by a filter on the %s hook.'=>'vaj %s hookDaq filter wIv, vaj tlhapbeʼ.','The %s hook has a filter set, so some log files may have different retention settings.'=>'%s hookDaq filter wIv, vaj log filemey DaqaSmoHmeH retentlon settings mIwDaq.','This sets how many days log entries will be kept before being auto-deleted.'=>'vaj log wejpu\' HoghDaq \'arlogh tIq chenmoH, vaj \'oH DeS jIbel \'e\' yItlhutlh.','days'=>'jajmey','This setting cannot be changed here because it is defined in the %1$s constant, probably in your %2$s file.'=>'vaj %1$s constantDaq wIv, naDev %2$s fileDaq wIv.','This sets the minimum severity level of logs that will be stored. Lower severity levels will be ignored. "None" means all logs will be stored.'=>'vaj log chenmoH \'arlogh HoghDaq \'arlogh tIq chenmoH. \'arlogh HoghDaq chenmoH QaQbe\'. "HoS" log Hoch chenmoH.','✅ Ready'=>'✅ Qap','⚠️ The file system is not configured for direct writes. This could cause problems for the logger.'=>'⚠️ choHmey Segh nIvbogh cha\'logh Daq jImejbe\'. vaj logwI\' lulo\'laHbe\'.','You may want to switch to the database for log storage.'=>'log chenmoH Daq DatabaseDaq lujmeH DuQwI\' Daghaj.','⚠️ The file system connection could not be initialized.'=>'⚠️ choHmey Segh QumwI\' latlh mIw vIghro\'be\'.','Log files are stored in this directory: %s'=>'log filemey DaqDaq: %s','⚠️ This directory does not appear to be writable.'=>'⚠️ chenmoH Daq Qapchu\' jImejbe\'.','Directory size: %s'=>'Daq size: %s','File system settings'=>'choHmey Segh mIw','Log entries are stored in this database table: %s'=>'log entries DaqDaq: %s','Database settings'=>'Database mIw','You do not have permission to manage logging settings.'=>'log chenmoH mIw chenmoH vIghro\'be\'.','Marketing'=>'marketing','Customize your online store with WooCommerce blocks'=>'WooCommerce blocksDaq Qay choH','With our blocks, you can select and display products, categories, filters, and more virtually anywhere on your site — no need to use shortcodes or edit lines of code. Learn more about how to use each one of them.'=>'blocks Daq, Hoch Daq yIlo\' \'ej yIqel, choHmey, filtermey je, HochDaq Qay HochDaq SaH. shortcode pagh mIw chenmoH pagh \'oHbe\'. HochDaq yItlhutlh yIqel.','How to customize your product catalog'=>'choHmey catalog chenmoH \'e\' nuqneH','You want your product catalog and images to look great and align with your brand. This guide will give you all the tips you need to get your products looking great in your store.'=>'catalogDaq choHmey \'ej QorwI\' Qapchu\' Daq Qapchu\'. ghojwI\'vam Hoch tips DaH jIbel \'oH Qapchu\'.','Edit products on the move'=>'choHmey Daq Qapchu\'','Edit and create new products from your mobile devices with the Woo app'=>'Woo app lo’ mobmeyl devicelIjDaq wovbe’ mIw je tlhap je’ products','Your store emails have had an upgrade!'=>'SuS wovbe’meyl bImejpu’!','We’ve made some exciting improvements to your email templates, including modern, shopper-friendly designs and new customization options. And if you’re using a block theme, you can automatically sync your theme styles! Head to your email settings to explore the new changes.'=>'wovbe’ mIw templatemeylIjDaq nIvbogh nIvbogh QaQmey wIlegh, \'ach modern, nopwI’pu’ je bImej je chaw’lIj je. \'ej block theme wIlo\' \'e\' DaSov, theme styleslIj wIghItlh Sync! Email settingslIj yIlegh \'ej nIvbogh chenmoHwI’pu’ yIqel.','Customize your emails'=>'EmailmeylIj bImej','Store emails have had an upgrade!'=>'SuS wovbe’meyl bImejpu’!','We’ve made some exciting improvements to our email templates, including modern, shopper-friendly designs and new customization options. And if you’re using a block theme, you can automatically sync your theme styles! Head to your email settings to explore the new features.'=>'wovbe’ mIw templatemeylIjDaq nIvbogh nIvbogh QaQmey wIlegh, \'ach modern, nopwI’pu’ je bImej je chaw’lIj je. \'ej block theme wIlo\' \'e\' DaSov, theme styleslIj wIghItlh Sync! Email settingslIj yIlegh \'ej nIvbogh chenmoHwI’pu’ yIqel.','Try the new templates'=>'nIvbogh templatemey yIlo\'','If your store is based in the EU, we recommend using the EU VAT Number extension in addition to automated taxes. It provides your checkout with a field to collect and validate a customer\'s EU VAT number, if they have one.'=>'EUDaq SuS wovbe’lIjDaq, EU VAT Number extension yIlo’ \'ej automated taxes je. SIQwI’ EU VAT number chenmoH \'ej Qutlh checkoutlIjDaq.','Collect and validate EU VAT numbers at checkout'=>'CheckoutlIjDaq EU VAT numbermey Qutlh \'ej Quch','Do you need help with adding your first product?'=>'wa’logh productlIj Qapla’ wIghItlhmeH ghu’?','This video tutorial will help you go through the process of adding your first product in WooCommerce.'=>'vaj video tutorial wo’ WooCommerceDaq wa’logh productlIj Qapla’ wIghItlhmeH ghu’.','Watch tutorial'=>'Tutorial yIlegh','You\'re invited to share your experience'=>'tugh Qapla’ DanoHmeH yIghItlh','Now that you’ve chosen us as a partner, our goal is to make sure we\'re providing the right tools to meet your needs. We\'re looking forward to having your feedback on the store setup experience so we can improve it in the future.'=>'maHvaD partner wIlo’ SoH, maH Qapla’ DanoHmeH yIlo\' tools Qapchu’ maH. SuS setup experience feedback yIqel, vaj maH nIvbogh mIw Qapchu’.','Share feedback'=>'feedback yIghItlh','We noticed that there was a problem during the Jetpack and WooCommerce Shipping & Tax install. Please try again and enjoy all the advantages of having the plugins connected to your store! Sorry for the inconvenience. The "Jetpack" and "WooCommerce Shipping & Tax" plugins will be installed & activated for free.'=>'Jetpack je WooCommerce Shipping & Tax install mIwDaq QaghwI’ wIlegh. Qapla’ wIghItlhmeH yIlo’, pluginswIj lo’! Sorry inconvenience. "Jetpack" je "WooCommerce Shipping & Tax" plugins wIghItlh \'ej wIlo’.','Uh oh... There was a problem during the Jetpack and WooCommerce Shipping & Tax install. Please try again.'=>'Uh oh... Jetpack je WooCommerce Shipping & Tax install mIwDaq QaghwI’ wIlegh. Qapla’ wIghItlhmeH yIlo’.','Install plugins'=>'plugins wIghItlh','To make sure you never get that sinking "what did I forget" feeling, we\'ve put together the essential pre-launch checklist.'=>'“nuq vIghro’” wIjwI’choHchu’ pagh, essential pre-launch checklist wIlegh.','Ready to launch your store?'=>'storelIj launch yIqel?','How to Migrate from Magento to WooCommerce'=>'Magento vItlhutlh WooCommerce vIje’','Changing platforms might seem like a big hurdle to overcome, but it is easier than you might think to move your products, customers, and orders to WooCommerce. This article will help you with going through this process.'=>'platform vItlhutlh chu’ yItlhutlh, \'ach products, nopwI’pu’ je orders WooCommerceDaq De’vID. Qagh tutorialvam mIw yIlegh.','Manage your orders on the go'=>'orders lIj mIw wIlo\'','Look for orders, customer info, and process refunds in one click with the Woo app.'=>'orders, customer info je refunds processing neH wa’ click Woo app.','Protect your WooCommerce Store with Jetpack Backup.'=>'WooCommerce StorelIj Jetpack Backup yIvang.','Store downtime means lost sales. One-click restores get you back online quickly if something goes wrong.'=>'store downtime means sales Qugh. wa’ click restore neH quick online vIghro’.','Get backups'=>'backupmey yIqel','Do you want to migrate from Shopify to WooCommerce?'=>'Shopify vItlhutlh WooCommerce vIje’?','Changing eCommerce platforms might seem like a big hurdle to overcome, but it is easier than you might think to move your products, customers, and orders to WooCommerce. This article will help you with going through this process.'=>'eCommerce platform vItlhutlh chu’ yItlhutlh, \'ach products, nopwI’pu’ je orders WooCommerceDaq De’vID. Qagh tutorialvam mIw yIlegh.','Install the WooCommerce mobile app to manage orders, receive sales notifications, and view key metrics — wherever you are.'=>'WooCommerce mobile app wIghItlh, orders yIlo’, sales notificationmey Qap, je key metrics yIlegh — nuqDaq bIQo’.','Install Woo mobile app'=>'Woo mobile app wIv','Woohoo, %1$s was your record day for sales! Net sales was %2$s beating the previous record of %3$s set on %4$s.'=>'Woohoo, %1$s ghotpu\'vam wIvDI\'lIj jIH! net wIv %2$s "record"vamwIj %3$s Qav "record"vam %4$s.','New sales record!'=>'wIv "record"vam!','Start accepting payments on your store!'=>'pay\'eghtaH mu\' bIH!','Take payments with the provider that’s right for you - choose from 100+ payment gateways for WooCommerce.'=>'pay\'eghtaH qImroqmeyDaq yImev - WooCommerce 100+ pay\'eghtaH "gateways" luch lut.','Start your online clothing store'=>'online chIS mu\' bIH','Starting a fashion website is exciting but it may seem overwhelming as well. In this article, we\'ll walk you through the setup process, teach you to create successful product listings, and show you how to market to your ideal audience.'=>'qeylIS mu\' bIH, vaj Qapchu\' Hoch. mu\' qachmey wIv, wIv product listings, je yIqaw marketing.','First order received'=>'wa\'leS wIv','Congratulations on processing %s orders!'=>'bIQapchu\' %s wIvmey!','Congratulations on getting your first order! Now is a great time to learn how to manage your orders.'=>'wa\'leS wIv, orders manage ghu\'be\'.','You\'ve hit the 10 orders milestone! Look at you go. Browse some WooCommerce success stories for inspiration.'=>'10 orders bIngDaq bIH! WooCommerce success stories yIqaw.','Another order milestone! Take a look at your Orders Report to review your orders to date.'=>'chuq bIngDaq orders! Orders Report yIqaw.','Review your orders'=>'orders yIqaw','We recently asked you if you wanted more information about %s. Run your business and manage your payments in one place with the solution built and supported by WooCommerce.'=>'maH yIqaw %s ghu\'be\'? yIqaw, WooCommerce solution yIv.','Payments made simple with %s'=>'pay\'eghtaH %s yIlo\'','Learn more here'=>'DaHjaj yIqaw','Save up to $800 in fees by managing transactions with %1$s. With %1$s, you can securely accept major cards, Apple Pay, and payments in over 100 currencies.'=>'pay\'eghtaH %1$s 800$ "fees" chel. %1$s major cards, Apple Pay, 100 currencies yIlo\'.','Save big with %s'=>'%s yIlo\' Qap','Track your store performance on mobile'=>'mobileDaq mu\' performance yI\'u','Monitor your sales and high performing products with the Woo app.'=>'sales, products yI monitor Woo app.','The homepage is one of the most important entry points in your store. When done right it can lead to higher conversions and engagement. Don\'t forget to personalize the homepage that we created for your store during the onboarding.'=>'homepage mu\'Daq wej wej. personal homepage yIqaw.','Personalize your store\'s homepage'=>'homepage personalize yIlo\'','Personalize homepage'=>'homepage personalize','Get notifications about store activity, including new orders and product reviews directly on your mobile devices with the Woo app.'=>'store activity notifications, orders, product reviews yIqaw Woo app.','Get real-time order alerts anywhere'=>'real-time order alerts yIqaw','Analytics now supports scheduled updates'=>'Analytics scheduled updates yI support','This provides improved performance to your store, enable it in Analytics > Settings.'=>'store performance Qap, Analytics > Settings yI enable.','Scheduled updates enabled'=>'scheduled updates enabled','Do you want to sell online courses?'=>'online courses wIv?','Online courses are a great solution for any business that can teach a new skill. Since courses don’t require physical product development or shipping, they’re affordable, fast to create, and can generate passive income for years to come. In this article, we provide you more information about selling courses using WooCommerce.'=>'online courses Qap skill teach. physical product, shipping Qapbe\'; affordable, quick; passive income. article yIqaw WooCommerce course wIv.','Gathering usage data allows us to improve WooCommerce. Your store will be considered as we evaluate new features, judge the quality of an update, or determine if an improvement makes sense. You can always visit the %1$sSettings%3$s and choose to stop sharing data. %2$sRead more%3$s about what data we collect.'=>'mIw vItlhutlhmeH WooCommerce vInejmeH. SoHvaD ghojmeH, vIq vIq vIje\' vIje\' vItlhutlh. SoHvaD vIje\' vItlhutlh, vIje\' vItlhutlh, pagh vItlhutlh vIq vIje\' je. Hoch vIje\' vItlhutlh %1$sSettings%3$s vItlhutlh \'ej vItlhutlh vIneH. %2$sRead more%3$s nuqDaq vIje\' vItlhutlh.','Help WooCommerce improve with usage tracking'=>'WooCommerce vItlhutlhmeH vItlhutlhmeH mIw vItlhutlh','Activate usage tracking'=>'vItlhutlhmeH mIw vItlhutlh','Usage tracking activated'=>'vItlhutlhmeH mIw vItlhutlh \'ej vItlhutlh','Potentially unsecured files were found in your uploads directory'=>'vaj vItlhutlh \'e\' vItlhutlhmey vIje\' vItlhutlhmey','Files that may contain %1$sstore analytics%2$s reports were found in your uploads directory - we recommend assessing and deleting any such files.'=>'vaj vItlhutlhmey vIje\' vItlhutlhmey %1$sstore analytics%2$s vItlhutlhmey vIje\' vItlhutlhmey - vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vInej vItlhutlhmey je.','Try the new way to get paid'=>'pay \'e\' vItlhutlhmey mIw vItlhutlh','Securely accept credit and debit cards on your site. Manage transactions without leaving your WordPress dashboard. Only with <strong>WooPayments</strong>.'=>'qawHaq \'e\' vItlhutlh je vItlhutlhmey nIvbogh. WordPress dashboardDaq mIw vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey. <strong>WooPayments</strong> vIje\'.','By clicking "Get started", you agree to our %1$sTerms of Service%2$s'=>'vItlhutlh "Get started" vItlhutlh \'e\' vIje\' vItlhutlh %1$sTerms of Service%2$s','Do you need more info about WooCommerce Subscriptions?'=>'WooCommerce Subscriptions vItlhutlh vItlhutlh \'e\' vIje\'?','WooCommerce Subscriptions allows you to introduce a variety of subscriptions for physical or virtual products and services. Create product-of-the-month clubs, weekly service subscriptions or even yearly software billing packages. Add sign-up fees, offer free trials, or set expiration periods.'=>'WooCommerce Subscriptions vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey. mIwDaq product-of-the-month clubs, weekly service subscriptions pagh yearly software billing packages vItlhutlh. mIwDaq sign-up fees, free trials pagh expiration periods vItlhutlh.','%s subscription expiring soon'=>'%s subscription poSmoH','Your subscription expires in %d days. Enable autorenew to avoid losing updates and access to support.'=>'SuSmoH \'oH %d jaj. autorenew vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlhmey.','Enable Autorenew'=>'Autorenew vItlhutlh','%s subscription expired'=>'%s subscription poSmoH','Your subscription expired on %s. Get a new subscription to continue receiving updates and access to support.'=>'subscriptionlIj %s poSmoH. updatemey je support qapchuʼlIj yItlhutlh.','Renew Subscription'=>'Subscription vItlhutlh','Setup wizard'=>'Setup wizard','WooCommerce Onboarding'=>'WooCommerce Onboarding','Profile Setup Wizard'=>'Profile Setup Wizard','If you need to access the setup wizard again, please click on the 