missals list for the incentive. Each dismissal entry includes a context and a timestamp. The `all` entry means the incentive was dismissed for all contexts.'=>'motlhbogh bImejnISmo\' QavwI\' mIw. Hoch Qavmey lugh Daqmey je poH. `all` lugh bImejnISmo\' Hoch Daqmey luchenmoH.','Context ID in which the incentive was dismissed.'=>'Daq ID \'oH motlhbogh bImejnISmo\' Qav.','Unix timestamp representing when the incentive was dismissed.'=>'Unix poH poHmey motlhbogh bImejnISmo\' Qav.','The link to dismiss the incentive.'=>'motlhbogh bImejnISmo\' Qav link.','The URL to dismiss the incentive.'=>'motlhbogh bImejnISmo\' Qav URL.','REST request GET %1$s failed with: (%2$s) %3$s'=>'REST ngeb GET %1$s Qav: (%2$s) %3$s','REST request POST %1$s failed with: (%2$s) %3$s'=>'REST ngeb POST %1$s Qav: (%2$s) %3$s','Shipping Label'=>'ghItlhDaj Qav','Antom'=>'Antom','Your trusted payments partner in Asia and around the world.'=>'Asia je qo\' DochmeyDaq SuvwI\' nejwI\' tlhegh.','The Payfast extension for WooCommerce enables you to accept payments by Credit Card and EFT via one of South Africa\'s most popular payment gateways. No setup fees or monthly subscription costs. Selecting this extension will configure your store to use South African rands as the selected currency.'=>'Payfast WooCommerce vIghro\' bImejnISmo\' mIw Credit Card je EFT South Africa QavmeyDaq. Setup fees pagh qImroq. Qavmey Payfast vIghro\' South African rands currency lulaj.','Paymob'=>'Paymob','Paymob is a leading payment gateway in the Middle East and Africa. Accept payments online and in-store with Paymob.'=>'Paymob Qav gateway Middle East je Africa. Paymob vIghro\' Qav wIghaj.','PayPal Payments lets you offer PayPal, Venmo (US only), Pay Later options and more.'=>'PayPal Payments PayPal, Venmo (US only), Pay Later je Datu\'vam vIghro\'.','Safe and secure payments using your customer\'s PayPal account.'=>'payPal account vIghro\' bImejnISmo\' Qav.','Payoneer Checkout is the next generation of payment processing platforms, giving merchants around the world the solutions and direction they need to succeed in today\'s hyper-competitive global market.'=>'Payoneer Checkout Qav processing platform, merchants qo\' Hoch Qavmey vaj success.','Paytrail'=>'Paytrail','Accept all popular payment methods for Finnish B2C and B2B customers'=>'Finnish B2C je B2B customers Hoch Qavmey vIghro\'.','PayU India'=>'PayU India','Enable PayU\'s exclusive plugin for WooCommerce to start accepting payments in 100+ payment methods available in India including credit cards, debit cards, UPI, & more!'=>'PayU exclusive WooCommerce plugin Qavmey 100+ methods India vIghro\'.','Securely accept credit and debit cards with one low rate, no surprise fees (custom rates available). Sell in store and track sales and inventory in one place.'=>'Qavmey Qatlh, surprise fees pagh (custom rates \'ej available). wIghaj je inventory Hoch Daqmey.','Stripe'=>'Stripe','Tilopay'=>'Tilopay','Accept credit and debit cards on your WooCommerce store with advanced features like partial refunds, full/partial captures, and 3D Secure security.'=>'WooCommerce store credit je debit cards vIghro\' features partial refunds, full/partial captures, 3D Secure.','Viva.com Smart Checkout'=>'Viva.com Smart Checkout','A European payments solution that allows you to accept payments in over 25 countries and multiple currencies.'=>'European payments solution 25+ countries je currencies vIghro\'.','Accept payments with Woo'=>'Woo vIje\'pay\'mo\' je','Credit/debit cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and more.'=>'QeD/debIt qIt, Apple Pay, Google Pay, je latlh.','Affirm\'s tailored Buy Now Pay Later programs remove price as a barrier, turning browsers into buyers, increasing average order value, and expanding your customer base.'=>'Affirm\'puq Buy Now Pay Later programmey mIw Hoch vItlhutlh, QeD vItlhutlh, SIQ vItlhutlh, je wIghItlhmey vIghItlh, reH mIw vIqel.','Clearpay'=>'Clearpay','Clearpay allows customers to receive products immediately and pay for purchases over four installments, always interest-free.'=>'Clearpay wIghItlhmey DaHjaj lo\'lu\'pu\' je pagh loS mIw vItlhutlh, reH SuQbe\'.','A full checkout experience embedded on your site that includes all popular payment methods (Pay Now, Pay Later, Financing, Installments).'=>'chaq checkout vItlhutlh DuQmeyDaq lo\'lu\'pu\' Hoch mIw QeDmey (Pay Now, Pay Later, Financing, Installments).','Helio Pay'=>'Helio Pay','Effortlessly accept cryptocurrency payments in your store.'=>'cryptocurrency QeDmey lo\'lu\'pu\' vItlhutlh.','MONEI'=>'MONEI','Accept Cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Bizum, PayPal, and many more payment methods in your store.'=>'QeDmey, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Bizum, PayPal, je latlh QeDmey vItlhutlh.','Take credit card payments securely via Eway keeping customers on your site.'=>'Eway vIghItlh QeDmey vItlhutlh, vIghItlhmeyDaq wItlhutlh.','Visa Acceptance Solutions'=>'Visa Acceptance Solutions','Accept payments on your WooCommerce store securely.'=>'WooCommerce vIghItlh QeDmey vItlhutlh.','N-Genius Online by Network'=>'N-Genius Online by Network','Power your business with N-Genius Online—smart, secure, and built for the future'=>'N-Genius Online QeDmey vItlhutlh—wIghItlh, SeHlaw\' je po\'wI\'.','GoCardless'=>'GoCardless','Accept Direct Debit, ACH Pull, and open banking payments.'=>'Direct Debit, ACH Pull, je open banking QeDmey vItlhutlh.','Nexi Checkout'=>'Nexi Checkout','A fully embedded checkout, with all popular payment methods, for more sales and less abandoned shopping carts.'=>'checkout Hoch mIw QeDmey vItlhutlh, QeDmey vItlhutlh je vay\' vItlhutlh.','Billie'=>'Billie','Billie is the leading provider of Buy Now, Pay Later payment methods for B2B stores.'=>'Billie B2B vIghItlh Buy Now, Pay Later QeDmey vItlhutlh.','This section shows details of WC Admin.'=>'vaj Daq WC Admin mIw vItlhutlh.','Enabled Features'=>'chu\' mIw','Which features are enabled?'=>'nuqneH chu\' mIw?','Disabled Features'=>'puS chu\' mIw','Which features are disabled?'=>'nuqneH puS chu\' mIw?','Daily Cron'=>'jajvam cron','Is the daily cron job active, when does it next run?'=>'jajvam cron mIw SeHlaw\'? nuqneH Qu\'?','Not scheduled'=>'Qapbe\'','Options'=>'chu\'','Do the important options return expected values?'=>'vaj ChoHmey Dunmey Qapchu\' vaj vItlhutlh?','Not all expected'=>'Hoch Dunmey Qapchu\'be\'','Notes'=>'QInmey','How many notes in the database?'=>'DatabeseDaq QInmey \'ar?','Onboarding'=>'Qapchu\'ghach','Was onboarding completed or skipped?'=>'Qapchu\'ghach vIleghbej \'ej vIchu\'laHbe\'?','Payments made simple — including WooPay, a new express checkout feature.'=>'QeylIS mIw wIv — WooPay, Qutlh jatlh checkout mIw chu\' chu\'ghach je.','Payments made simple, with no monthly fees – designed exclusively for WooCommerce stores. Accept credit cards, debit cards, and other popular payment methods.'=>'QeylIS mIw wIv, jar wa\'leS pagh – WooCommerce Dughajbogh mIw wIv tlhIngan Hol. credit cardmey, debit cardmey, \'ej mIw qeylISmey chutlhmey wIv.','Dismiss the gateway'=>'tlhIngan mIw chep','Platform %s not found.'=>'%s mIw lo\'taHbe\'.','Invalid fetcher class for platform %s. Fetcher must be a non-empty string.'=>'%s mIw fetcher class Qapchu\'be\'. Fetcher \'oH vIghro\' mIw.','Invalid fetcher class for platform %1$s. Class %2$s does not exist.'=>'%1$s mIw fetcher class Qapchu\'be\'. %2$s class Hoch Qapbe\'.','Invalid fetcher class for platform %1$s. Class %2$s does not implement %3$s.'=>'%1$s mIw fetcher class Qapchu\'be\'. %2$s class %3$s QI\'vItlhbe\'.','Invalid mapper class for platform %s. Mapper must be a non-empty string.'=>'%s mIw mapper class Qapchu\'be\'. Mapper \'oH vIghro\' mIw.','Invalid mapper class for platform %1$s. Class %2$s does not exist.'=>'%1$s mIw mapper class Qapchu\'be\'. %2$s class Hoch Qapbe\'.','Invalid mapper class for platform %1$s. Class %2$s does not implement %3$s.'=>'%1$s mIw mapper class Qapchu\'be\'. %2$s class %3$s QI\'vItlhbe\'.','Coming soon'=>'DaH matlh','Store coming soon'=>'Dughajbogh DaH matlh','Live'=>'yIjatlh','