us compliance'=>'{{strong}}wa\'logh{{/strong}} Qapchu\' economic nexus compliance','100% free'=>'','Continue setup'=>'Qumbe\' Qatlh','Stripe Tax'=>'Stripe Tax','Powerful global tax tool'=>'Qatlhbogh wo\' law\' tax mIw','Multi-economic nexus compliance'=>'Mehr economic nexus compliance','Detailed tax transaction reports'=>'Qatlh tax mIw QapwI\' Qel','Coverage in over 55 countries'=>'55 yuQmeyDaq Qap','Free to install, then pay as you go.'=>'bIQ Daghaj, vaj ghIq yItlhutlh.','Continue to setttings'=>'settings Qumbe\'','Install for free'=>'bIQ Daghaj','Stripe Tax for Woocommerce has been successfully installed. Let\'s configure it now.'=>'Stripe Tax WooCommerce mIw Daghajta\'; Daqtagh. vIvoqHa\'be\'.','Configure'=>'Qatlh','By clicking "Configure" you\'re enabling tax rates and calculations. More info {{link}}here{{/link}}.'=>'Qatlh pong "Configure" mIw tax rates je calculations Qapchu\' Qap. QIn {{link}}vam{{/link}}.','Please enter an address'=>'ghItlh address','Please enter a post code'=>'ghItlh post code','Please enter a city'=>'ghItlh muD','Configure tax rates'=>'Qatlh tax rates','Head over to the tax rate settings screen to configure your tax rates'=>'tax rate settings mIw Qumbe\' Qatlh','Choose a tax partner'=>'Qatlh tax partner','Set up taxes manually'=>'tax Qatlh manually','I don’t charge sales tax'=>'jIyIn sales tax','Visit {{Link}}the WooCommerce Marketplace{{/Link}} to find more tax solutions.'=>'Visit {{Link}}WooCommerce Marketplace{{/Link}} tax solutions Qap.','Good news!'=>'majQa\'','{{strong}}WooCommerce Tax{{/strong}} can automate your sales tax calculations for you.'=>'{{strong}}WooCommerce Tax{{/strong}} sales tax calculations Qapchu\' automation.','No thanks, I\'ll set up manually'=>'ghobeʼ, jIyInwIʼ yIqel','I don\'t charge sales tax'=>'jIyIn tlhIngan Hop chuʼ','Set up tax rates manually'=>'tlhIngan Hop DuQmey yIqel','My business doesn\'t charge sales tax'=>'wIj chab jIyIn tlhIngan Hop chuʼ','Set up manually'=>'yIqel','Install WooCommerce Tax'=>'WooCommerce Tax yIqel','WooCommerce Tax allows you to automate sales tax calculations'=>'WooCommerce Tax tlhIngan Hop DuQmey Sam yIloʼ','Connect your store to WordPress.com to enable automated sales tax calculations'=>'maSuvpuʼ WordPress.com loDmeyDaq qoS yIqel tlhIngan Hop DuQmey Sam','There was a problem setting up automated taxes. Please try again.'=>'tlhIngan Hop DuQmey Sam yIqel vIghroʼ. bopummeH yIghoS.','You’re awesome! One less item on your to-do list ✅'=>'SoH qaq! waʼ mIw wIj vItlhutlh ✅','%1$s — %2$s per year'=>'%1$s — %2$s DIS','Would you like to add the following paid features to your store now?'=>'DaH jIyInwIʼlIjDaq nIvbogh mIw chImmey yIqel?','You won’t have access to this functionality until the extensions have been purchased and installed.'=>'jIyInwIʼlIjDaq mIw chImmey wIghorghmeH yIqel, loʼlaHbeʼ.','I’ll do it later'=>'waʼleS jIyInwIʼ yIqel','Store location illustration'=>'jIyInwIʼ Daq qoStaʼ','First, tell us about your store'=>'waʼleS, jIyInwIʼlIj vIjatlh','Get your store up and running in no time. Add your store’s address to set up shipping, tax and payments faster.'=>'jIyInwIʼlIj vIghojbogh Qapchuʼ. jIyInwIʼlIj DaqDaq chaʼlogh, tlhIngan Hop, je ngevwIʼvam yIqel.','Add details'=>'mIw chIm','Use our built-in AI tools to design your store and populate it with content, or select a pre-built theme and customize it to fit your brand.'=>'maQapchuʼ AI QumwIʼmey yIloʼ jIyInwIʼlIj bIghHaʼ, pagh QumwIʼmey bIloʼ je vIghaj.','Quickly create a beautiful looking store using our built-in store designer, or select a pre-built theme and customize it to fit your brand.'=>'maQapchuʼ jIyInwIʼ bIghHaʼ QumwIʼ yIloʼ, pagh QumwIʼmey bIloʼ je vIghaj.','Customize your store illustration'=>'jIyInwIʼ qoStaʼ mIw chIm','Start customizing your store'=>'jIyInwIʼ qoStaʼ mIw chIm','Start customizing'=>'mIw chIm','Tax illustration'=>'tlhIngan Hop qoStaʼ','Configure your tax settings'=>'tlhIngan Hop Settings chIm','Choose to set up your tax rates manually, or use one of our tax automation tools.'=>'tlhIngan Hop DuQmey yIqel, pagh tlhIngan Hop Sam QumwIʼmey lo.','Shipping illustration'=>'ngevwIʼ qoStaʼ','Choose where and how you’d like to ship your products, along with any fixed or calculated rates.'=>'chabmeyDaq nuqDaq, qatlh ngevwIʼ yIqel, pagh chImQoʼ.','Start shipping'=>'ngevwIʼ yIqel','Marketing illustration'=>'tlhIngan Hop mIw qoStaʼ','Reach more customers'=>'naghmey vIghaj','Start growing your business by showcasing your products on social media and Google, boost engagement with email marketing, and more!'=>'SoHvaDmeywIjDaq nIvbogh tIqwIj neH, Google je, De\' chu\'ghachDaq tIqwIj Saj, email chenmoHmeH wovbe\' engagement, \'ej latlh!','Appearance illustration'=>'mIw chenmoH illustration','Payment illustration'=>'Qap illustration','It’s time to get paid'=>'poH naQmeyvam luQ','Give your customers an easy and convenient way to pay! Set up one (or more!) of our fast and secure online or in person payment methods.'=>'naghmeylIjpu\'vaD ghu\'vam \'ej yIlo\'! wa\' (vaj Hoch!) Qap nIvbogh De\' Qapmey yIlo\' online pagh loS payment \'ej.','Get paid'=>'naghmeylIj','Products illustration'=>'naghmey illustration','List your products'=>'naghmeylIj mIw','Start selling by adding products or services to your store. Choose to list products manually, or import them from a different store. '=>'naghmey pagh mIwmey wo\' nIvbogh tIqwIj vIje\'pu\'. SIQpu\' pagh pagh yIlo\' manually pagh yIlo\' vaj pagh pagh wo\' mIw. ','Purchase illustration'=>'Sop illustration','Good choice! You chose to add amazing new features to your store. Continue to checkout to complete your purchase.'=>'nIvbogh wIje\'! naghmeylIjDaq Qumpu\'bogh \'ej ghu\'vam vIje\'. checkoutDaq yIvummeH mIw.','Power your payments with a simple, all-in-one option. Verify your business details to start managing transactions with WooCommerce Payments.'=>'WooCommerce Payments lo\'taHghachmey vItlhutlh. yItlhutlh Hoch business mIw vItlhutlh transactionmey.','Launch Your Store illustration'=>'Wo\' launch illustration','Your store is ready for launch!'=>'Wo\' vIghro\' launch!','It’s time to celebrate – you’re ready to launch your store! Woo! Hit the button to preview your store and make it public.'=>'poH Daq yItIv – Wo\' launch vIghro\'! Woo! bIr mIw yIlo\' Wo\' chu\'chu\'.','Launch store'=>'Wo\' launch','Hide store setup tasks'=>'Wo\' setup mIw vaj','Are you sure? These tasks are required for all stores.'=>'vaj \'a\'? Hoch Wo\' mIw vaj \'oH.','Yes, hide store setup tasks'=>'HIja\', Wo\' setup mIw vaj','You’ve completed store setup'=>'Wo\' setup mIw vIje\'.','Hide this list'=>'vaj list vaj','Task List Options'=>'mIw List Settings','Hide this'=>'vaj','Hide setup list'=>'setup list vaj','Follow these steps to start selling quickly. %1$d out of %2$d complete.'=>'mIwvam yIghoj pagh SoHvaDmey yIlo\' je. %1$d %2$dDaq vIqaw.','Task dismissed'=>'mIw vaj','Congratulations! Take a moment to celebrate and look out for the first sale.'=>'majQa\'! poH Daq yItIv \'ej pagh sale Qap.','How was your experience?'=>'qatlh QumwI\'vam?','We appreciate your feedback!'=>'qaStaHvIS feedbacklIj vIghItlh!','The store setup is easy to complete.'=>'DughajmeH wo’mo’ Hemey SIQtaH.','The store setup process meets my needs.'=>'DughajmeH wo’mo’ Hemey vIghojtaH.','WooCommerce Home'=>'WooCommerce juH','Task postponed until tomorrow'=>'laHmey wa’leS HIq','Show %d more task.'=>'%d mIw tIq vIlegh.' . "\0" . '%d mIw tIqmey vIlegh.','Show less'=>'Qej vIlegh','Display'=>'QIH','Show things to do next'=>'QaH qachmey vIlegh','Step completed'=>'mIw ghu’vam DIvI’','Step active'=>'mIw ghu’vam yIqaw','Step %1$s of %2$s'=>'mIw %1$s %2$sDaq','Set up WooPayments'=>'WooPayments SIQ','Currently selected: %s'=>'DaH jImej: %s','No selection'=>'chu’laHbe’','Search…'=>'Qel…','Select if you run your own business as an individual and are self-employed'=>'nuvpu’ wIjDaq jIQong ‘ej HuchwIj wIjDaq jIQong','Select if you filed documentation to register your business with a government agency'=>'DuSaQvam lo’laHbe’ghachDaq wIchenmoH','Select if you run a non-business entity'=>'DuSaQvam wIjDaq lo’laHbe’ghach','Select if your business is classed as a government entity'=>'DuSaQvam DuSaQvamDaq yIchenmoH','Select if you have been granted tax-exempt status by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS)'=>'IRS mIw HevmeH DuSaQvamwIj yImev','Start accepting real payments'=>'Huch wIv','You are currently testing payments on your store. To activate real payments, you will need to provide some additional details about your business. {{link}}Learn more{{/link}}.'=>'DughajmeH wo’mo’ HemeywIj HaStaH. HaStaH wIv, DuSaQvamwIj tIqwIjDaq mIw tIqwIjmey vIghItlh. {{link}}Qel vIghItlh{{/link}}.','Let’s get your store ready to accept payments'=>'DughajmeH wo’mo’ HemeywIj HaStaH wo’','We’ll use these details to enable payments for your store. This information can’t be changed after your account is created.'=>'vIghItlhmeH wo’mo’ HemeywIj HaStaH vIqaw. mIw vIghItlhmeH bImejHa’.','Please share a few more details'=>'Qapchu’ mIw vIlo’','This info will help us speed up the set up process.'=>'mIw vIlo’meH mIw vIqaw.','One last step! Verify your identity with our partner'=>'wa’ mIw lo’laHbe’ghach! wIj partner vIlo’','This will take place in a secure environment through our partner. Once your business details are verified, you’ll be redirected back to your store dashboard.'=>'mIw wIj partnerDaq Qapchu’ vIlo’. DuSaQvamwIj Qapchu’ vIlo’, juHwI’ Dochvam mIwHa’ vIqaw.','Finish your verification process'=>'mIw vIqaw','This info will verify your account'=>'mIw accountwIj vIqaw','Where is your business located?'=>'nuqDaq \'oH SuvwI\' qem?','What type of legal entity is your business?'=>'nuq \'oH SuvwI\' qonwI\' ghotvetlh qem?','What category of legal entity identify your business?'=>'nuq Hutlh qonwI\' ghotvetlh SuvwI\' chenmoH?','What type of goods or services does your business sell? '=>'nuq \'oH mIw, \'ej Seghmey SuvwI\' vangqang?','Please provide a response'=>'vaj wIvDI\' Sovbe\' vIghaj','Please provide a country'=>'vaj qo\' Sovbe\' vIghaj','Please 