{{current /}} {{total /}} \'ej','Previous Alert'=>'muD DaqaSmoH','Next Alert'=>'vaj DaqaSmoH','Something went wrong while triggering this note\'s action.'=>'Qapla’be’: nuqDaq vo’ vIghro’ yIlo’.','Later Today'=>'DaHjaj poH','Tomorrow'=>'wa’leS','Next Week'=>'mIw votlh','Next Month'=>'jar votlh','Remind Me Later'=>'DaHjaj yIbuS','Choose which analytics to display and the section name'=>'qatlh DaqaSmoH, mIwDaq yIchoH','Store Performance'=>'ghItlhwI’ qo’','Hi%s, run your business and manage your payments all in one place, with no setup costs or monthly fees.'=>'nuqDaq %s, Dujvam yImev \'ej pagh ngaSwI’ qIqDaq bImej, pagh vItlhutlh pagh jar.','By using %1$s you agree to our <a1>Terms of Service</a1> and acknowledge that you have read our <a2>Privacy Policy</a2>. Discount will be applied to payments processed via %1$s upon completion of installation, setup, and connection. '=>'%1$s yIlo’ \'e’ DaHjaj <a1>ngoqmey qonwI’</a1> \'ej <a2>motlhwI’ QInmey</a2> vIghro’ \'e’ yImev. Qapchu’ vItlhutlhmey %1$s DaqaSmoH je, mIw, qap je DuH.','By using %1$s you agree to our <a1>Terms of Service</a1> (including WooPay <a3>merchant terms</a3>) and acknowledge that you have read our <a2>Privacy Policy</a2>. Discount will be applied to payments processed via %1$s upon completion of installation, setup, and connection. '=>'%1$s yIlo’ \'e’ DaHjaj <a1>ngoqmey qonwI’</a1> (WooPay <a3>qorwI’ ngoqmey</a3> je) \'ej <a2>motlhwI’ QInmey</a2> vIghro’. Qapchu’ vItlhutlhmey %1$s DaqaSmoH je, mIw, qap je DuH.','*See <a>Terms and Conditions</a> for details.'=>'*QInmey <a>ngoqmey qonwI’</a> yIqel.','%s is pre-integrated with all popular payment options'=>'%s Hoch nIvbogh qIqmey vImuS.','& more'=>'& Qapla’','No thanks, I don’t want %s'=>'%s jIyajbe’, jIQubbe’.','Note that the extension hasn’t been installed. This will simply dismiss our limited time offer. Please take a moment to tell us why you’d like to dismiss the %s offer.'=>'Qapbe’: qonwI’ vItlhutlhbe’. HechmuSvaD wIqel. qatlh %s qonwI’ wIqelmeH bImev