pe its exact label and separate with commas or the Enter key.'=>'choHmey vItlhutlhbogh, DeʼwIʼ DuqIppuʼ \'eʼ yIjatlh, \'ej yIqawmeH qachmey je pagh Enter mIw.','Separate with commas or the Enter key.'=>'qachmey je pagh Enter mIw.','Remove all'=>'Hoch vItlhutlh','%1$s (%2$d of %3$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d %3$dDaq)','+ %d more'=>'+ %d vaj','Oops, something went wrong. Please try again'=>'tlhIngan Hol vIjatlhlaHbeʼ. yIqaw, yItlhutlh.','Please share your feedback'=>'qaStaHvIS neH, DochmeylIj yItlhutlh','Strongly disagree'=>'tugh jIjatlhbeʼ','Disagree'=>'jIjatlhbeʼ','Neutral'=>'chuqmeH','Agree'=>'jIjatlh','Strongly Agree'=>'tugh jIjatlh','Your feedback will help create a better experience for thousands of merchants like you. Please tell us to what extent you agree or disagree with the statements below.'=>'DochmeylIj mIwvaD nuqneH Hoch tIghmeymey peghmey Qapchuʼ. Dochmey luj vItlhutlhmeH, bISav.','How is that screen useful to you? What features would you add or change?'=>'vaj tIghvam nuqneH? nuqmey yItaH \'ej yItlhutlh?','Your feedback will go to the WooCommerce development team'=>'DochmeylIj WooCommerce mIw QumwI\'vaD DaQum.','Optional, but much apprecated. We love reading your feedback!'=>'muSHa\' \'ach yItlhutlh. DochmeylIj yIlegh!','Please tell us to what extent you agree or disagree with the statements above.'=>'DochmeylIj vItlhutlhmeH, bISav.','Give feedback'=>'DochmeylIj yItlhutlh','How easy was it to filter your store analytics?'=>'Qutlhmey leghmeH Hoch mIw vIlo\'? ','The filters in the analytics screen are easy to use.'=>'Qutlhmey tIghDaq vIlo\' vIghro\'vam.','The filters\' functionality meets my needs.'=>'Qutlhmey mIw vIghro\'vam vItlhutlh.','How is your experience with editing products?'=>'mIwDaq Huchmey vIlo\'? ','How\'s your experience with editing products?'=>'mIwDaq Huchmey vIlo\'? ','We noticed you started editing a product, then left. How was it? Your feedback will help create a better experience for thousands of merchants like you.'=>'mIwDaq Huch vIlaj, vaj jImej. vaj nuqneH? DochmeylIj Qapchu\' Hoch tIghmeymey peghmey Qap.','How is your experience with creating products?'=>'mIwDaq Huchmey vImey?','We noticed you started creating a product, then left. How was it? Your feedback will help create a better experience for thousands of merchants like you.'=>'mIwDaq Huchmey vIlaj, vaj jImej. vaj nuqneH? DochmeylIj Qapchu\' Hoch tIghmeymey peghmey Qap.','The product creation screen is easy to use'=>'mIwDaq Huchmey vIlo\' Qapchu\'.','The product creation screen\'s functionality meets my needs'=>'mIwDaq Huchmey mIw vIghro\'vam vItlhutlh.','Did you find the right setting?'=>'Qapchu\' tlhapbogh mIw vIlegh?','How’s your experience with settings?'=>'nuqneH settings mIw vIghro\'?','We noticed you started changing store settings, then left. How was it? Your feedback will help create a better experience for thousands of merchants like you.'=>'maHvaD settings mIw chenmoHmo\' bIje\'pu\'bogh, vaj pa\' law\' DaH. chay\' DaH? bIghHa\' vIneH \'oHmeH Qapchu\' mIw tIq nIvbogh mIwmey Dun nobmeH, SoH Qutlhmey tIqwIj.','The settings screen is easy to use'=>'settings mIw lo\'laHbe\' \'oH','The settings screen\'s functionality meets my needs'=>'settings mIw mIw Qapchu\' vIneH','How easy or difficult was it to update this order?'=>'chay\' neH mIw vIghro\' vItlhutlh?','How\'s your experience with orders?'=>'orders mIw vIghro\' nuqneH?','We noticed you started editing an order, then left. How was it? Your feedback will help create a better experience for thousands of merchants like you.'=>'orders mIw chenmoHmo\' bIje\'pu\'bogh, vaj pa\' law\' DaH. chay\' DaH? bIghHa\' vIneH \'oHmeH Qapchu\' mIw tIq nIvbogh mIwmey Dun nobmeH, SoH Qutlhmey tIqwIj.','The order editing screen is easy to use'=>'orders mIw lo\'laHbe\' \'oH','The order details screen\'s functionality meets my needs'=>'orders mIw mIw Qapchu\' vIneH','How is your experience with importing products?'=>'products import mIw vIghro\' nuqneH?','How\'s your experience with importing products?'=>'products