duct here. Ideally a JPEG or PNG about 600 px wide or bigger. This image will be shown in your store’s catalog.'=>'mIw mIn DuQ upload yItaH. JPEG joq PNG 600 px latlh. mIw DuQ catalogDaq yIlegh.','Add your product tags'=>'mIw tagmey yItaH.','Add your product tags here. Tags are a method of labeling your products to make them easier for customers to find. For example, if you sell clothing, and you have a lot of cat prints, you could make a tag for “cat.”'=>'mIw tagmey yItaH. tagmey mIwvam mIw laH DaghItlh. example: mIw tag "cat".','Add your product categories'=>'mIw categorymey yItaH.','Add your product categories here. Assign categories to your products to make them easier to browse through and find in your store.'=>'mIw categorymey yItaH. mIw categorymey yIqaw, mIwDaq Daqmey yIghItlh.','Publish your product 🎉'=>'mIw yIlo\' 🎉','Good work! Now you can publish your product to your store by hitting the “Publish” button or keep editing it.'=>'majQa\'! DaH mIw yIlo\' "yIlo\'" patlh yIlo\' pagh yIlo\'.','Keep editing'=>'ghItlh vItlhutlh','Return to payments settings'=>'Qapchu’ Daghajbogh pagh veb','Business location :'=>'QemwIj tu’lu’be’ :','Loading %s settings…'=>'Loading %s settings…','Recommended settings applied.'=>'Qapchu’ settings lo’laHbe’.','Use recommended settings'=>'Qapchu’ settings lo’','{{b}}Inconsistent tax settings:{{/b}} To avoid possible rounding errors, prices should be entered and displayed consistently in all locations either including, or excluding taxes.'=>'{{b}}mIw vItlhutlhHa’ tax settings:{{/b}} wIghajtaHvIS mIw qengwI’pu’, neHpu’ vItlhutlh HochHomDaq lutlhutlhlaHbe’ ’e’ ghu’vamDaq, chay’lu’ vItlhutlh HochHomDaq ’ej pagh taxmey je nItlh.','Payment Methods'=>'Qapchu’ wIv','Installed payment methods are listed below and can be sorted to control their display order on the frontend.'=>'Qapchu’ wIv mIwDaq vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlh ‘ej ngoqvamDaq vItlhutlh vItlhutlhmey vItlhutlh vItlhutlh mIwDaq.','Confirm switch to ‘Coming soon’ mode'=>'Qapchu’ ‘Coming so